<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Masenyi Dɔnxɔɛ Siida</para>
  <para style="toc1">Annabi Munsa xa Masenyi Dɔnxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Masenyi Dɔnxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dɔn</para>
  <para style="mt">Tawureta Munsa</para>
  <para style="mt">Annabi Munsa xa Masenyi Dɔnxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala a xa masenyi singee fixi won ma Annabi Munsa nan saabui ra. Na masenyi dɔxɔ suulie findixi kitaabui keren nan na, naxan xili falama Tawureta Munsa. A dɔxɔ singe Ala xa ɲama fɔlɔ ki nan masenma. Ala to Annabi Iburahima sugandi, a a xɛɛ Kanaan bɔxi ma, a xa die naxa findi bɔnsɔɛ belebele ra mɛnni. Annabi Yaxuba waxati, kaamɛ naxa din bɔxi ra e nu dɛnnaxɛ. Annabi Yaxuba xa die naxa siga Misira bɔxi ma baloe fende. Ala naxa a ragiri, e xa e xunya Yusufu li naa. Annabi Yusufu naxa e mali a fanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala naxa na bɔnsɔɛ mali han e findi si belebele ra. Ɲɛ wuyaxi to dangi, Misira mangɛ naxa gaaxu fɔlɔ e ya ra. A naxa e findi konyie ra alako e naxa nɔ Misirakae ra. Na konyiya naxa bu han Ala Annabi Munsa xɛɛ tɛmui naxɛ. Ala naxa a mali xɔrɛya fide a xa mixie ma. E naxa mini Misira bɔxi ma Ala sɛnbɛ saabui ra, naxan baa bɔtini maba alako e xa a igiri e sanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na kaabanako belebele xanbi, Ala naxa e xun ti Kanaan bɔxi ra, a dɛnnaxɛ fi e ma. Kira ra, Ala naxa mini e ma Turusinina geya fari. A naxa a xa yaamari fu fi Annabi Munsa ma, e sɛbɛxi gɛmɛ walaxɛ ma. Ala man naxa sɛriyɛ gbɛtɛ fala Annabi Munsa bɛ alako ɲama xa lu e Marigi sagoe. Kɔnɔ ɲama naxa Alatala matandi sanya wuyaxi gbengberenyi ma. Na taruxui birin sɛbɛxi Tawureta Munsa nan kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">Beenun e xa Kanaan bɔxi sɔtɔ, Annabi Munsa naxa e malan yire keren. Mɛnni a naxa yi taruxui birin madɔxɔ e bɛ. A man naxa gbilen Ala xa sɛriyɛ birin ma alako e naxa nɛɛmu a ma Kanaan. A to gɛ na birin tagi raba e bɛ, e naxa laayidi tongo birafe ra Ala xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra. Na masenyi dɔxɔ suuli nde birin xili falama, «Annabi Munsa xa masenyi dɔnxɔɛ.» Na dangi xanbi, Annabi Munsa naxa laaxiraya geya fari.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi kitaabui lɔnni fima won ma alako won xa Ala xa sɛriyɛ kolon. Ala xa won mali na kolonfe ra. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Tawureta Munsa</para>
  <para style="imte">Annabi Munsa xa Masenyi Dɔnxɔɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Munsa xa masenyi singe</para>
  <para style="s">Kelife Xorebe geya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Wɔyɛnyie nan yi ki, Annabi Munsa naxan masen Isirayilakae birin bɛ. Na tɛmui a nu na Yurudɛn sogetede biri ra, gbengberenyi ma naxan na Araba, Sufi ya tagi, Paran, Tofeli, Laban, Xaseroti, nun Disahabi longori. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Keli Xorebe geya han Kadesi Barineya kira ra minife ra Seyiri geyae biri, xi fu nun keren ɲɛrɛ na a ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />E xa keli ɲɛ tongo naani nde ma Misira, a kike fu nun keren nde, xi singe, Annabi Munsa naxa Alatala xa yaamari masen Isirayilakae bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Na tɛmui Annabi Munsa nu bara xutu sɔtɔ Sixɔn ma, Amori mangɛ, naxan nu sabatixi Xɛsibɔn, a nun Ogo, Basan mangɛ, naxan nu sabatixi Asataroti nun Edereyi. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Yurudɛn sogetede biri Mowaba bɔxi ma, Annabi Munsa naxa Ala xa sɛriyɛ tagi raba e bɛ. Na wɔyɛnyi nan yi ki.<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />«Won nu na Xorebe geya yire tɛmui naxɛ, won Marigi Alatala yi nan masen won bɛ, ‹Wo bara bu yi geya bun ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Wo ti kira xɔn ma fa. Wo xa siga geya ma Amorikae na dɛnnaxɛ, nun na longori birin, Araba bɔxi ma, geya biri, Sefela nun Negewi biri, baa dɛ ra, han Kanaan bɔxi ma, han Liban sa dɔxɔ Efirati xure belebele ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Wo xa na bɔxi mato, n naxan fixi wo ma. Wo siga, wo xa na tongo, barima n tan Alatala yati nan na bɔxi laayidi tongoxi wo benbae bɛ, Iburahima, Isiyaga, a nun Yaxuba, a nun e bɔnsɔɛ birin hali e dangi xanbi.›»<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annabi Munsa xa kiitisae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />«Na tɛmui n yi nan fala wo bɛ, ‹N tan keren mu nɔma wo xa fe nɔde. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Wo Marigi Alatala bara wo ragbo yɛ. Yakɔsi wo bara gbo yɛ alɔ tunbuie naxee na koore ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Wo benbae Marigi Alatala xa wo rawuya han. A xa baraka sa wo xa fe alɔ a masen ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />N tan keren nɔma wo xa kalamuie makiitide di? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Wo kuntigi lɔnnilae sugandi, naxee kolonxi wo bɔnsɔɛe ya ma. N nee nan findima ɲama yareratie ra.› <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Wo naxa n yaabi, a n ma maɲɔxunyi, a maɲɔxun fanyi na a ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />N naxa wo xa yareratie tongo, wo xa kuntigi lɔnnila naxee kolonxi wo bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. N naxa e findi mixi wulu, mixi kɛmɛ, mixi tongo suuli, mixi fu xunyie ra. N naxa e findi yareratie ra wo bɔnsɔɛe ya ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Na tɛmui n naxa yaamari so wo makiitimae yi ra. N naxɛ, ‹Wo xa wo tuli mati wo baribooree ra. Wo xa birin makiiti sɛriyɛ kɛɲa ma, wo ngaxakerenyie tagi nun e tan nun xɔɲɛe tagi. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Wo naxa ti mixi yo xɔn ma kiiti sade. Wo naxa xurunyi nun gboe mato. Wo naxa gaaxu mixi yo ya ra, barima kiitisa na Ala nan na. Xa kiiti sa xɔrɔxɔ wo bɛ han, wo fa a ra n xɔn, n tan kiiti sama.› <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Na ki n bara fe birin masen wo bɛ, a lan wo xa naxan naba.»<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ala matandife Kadesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />«Na to dangi, won naxa keli Xorebe geya, won mini gbengberenyi magaaxuxi ra wo bara dɛnnaxɛ to. Won naxa bira kira fɔxɔ ra naxan sigama Amori geyae biri ra, alɔ won Marigi Alatala a masen won bɛ ki naxɛ. Won naxa so Kadesi Barineya. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />N naxa a fala wo bɛ, ‹Wo bara Amori geyae li, won Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fixi won ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Wo a mato, wo Marigi Alatala bara yi bɔxi ti won ya i. Wo siga, wo xa na tongo alɔ wo benbae Marigi Alatala a falaxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ. Wo naxa gaaxu, wo xa limaniya.›»<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />«Na tɛmui, wo birin naxa fa n yire, wo fa a fala n bɛ, ‹Won xa mixie xɛɛ, e xa siga yi bɔxi ma, e xa naa rabɛn. Na xa findi nee fan ma wali ra, alako won xa a kolon won lan won xa won ɲɛrɛ kira naxan xɔn a nun won sigama taa naxee.› <verse eid="DEU 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Wo xa maɲɔxunyi naxa findi n bɛ fe fanyi ra. Na nan a to n naxa xɛmɛ mixi fu nun firin mayegeti wo ya ma, wo bɔnsɔɛ keren keren ma tagi. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />E naxa siga geyae biri ra han e naxa gulunba li naxan xili Esekoli. E naxa naa rabɛn. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />E naxa yi bɔxi bogisee ba, e fa e masen won bɛ. E naxa dɛntɛgɛ sa won bɛ yi ki, ‹Won Marigi Alatala bɔxi fanyi nan fixi won ma.› <verse eid="DEU 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />Kɔnɔ wo mu tin tede, wo naxa tondi wo Marigi Alatala xa yaamari ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Wo a maxɔrɔxɔ nɛ wo xa kiri banxie kui. Wo naxa a fala, ‹Xɔnnanteya na xɛɛxi, Alatala won tongoxi Misira bɔxi ma. A wama won sofe Amorikae nan yi ra alako e xa won halaki. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Won sigama minden? Limaniya mu na won bɛ, barima won ngaxakerenyie bara a fala won bɛ a mɛnnikae sɛnbɛ gbo. E man gbangbalan won bɛ, nun na taae xa fe maxɔrɔxɔ. Tɛtɛ naxan naa rabilinxi, a ite han. Muxu Anaki bɔnsɔɛe yati to nɛ.›»<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />«N naxa a fala wo bɛ, ‹Wo naxa siikɛ. Wo naxa gaaxu e ya ra! <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Wo Marigi Alatala naxan ɲɛrɛma wo ya ra, a gere soma nɛ wo bɛ alɔ a a rabaxi wo ya xɔri ki naxɛ Misira bɔxi ma han gbengberenyi ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />Wo man bara a to, wo Marigi Alatala faxi nɛ wo ra alɔ xɛmɛ a xa di xaninma ki naxɛ, wo ɲɛrɛxi kira naxan birin na han wo naxa fa be li. <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Kɔnɔ na birin kui, wo mu nu laxi wo Marigi Alatala ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />A tan nan ti wo ya ra, a yire fen wo bɛ wo luma dɛnnaxɛ. Kɔɛ ra a tan nan nu kira iyalanma wo bɛ tɛ ra. Yanyi fan na, a findi nuxui ra, a ti wo ya ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />Alatala naxa wo xurutuxurutu xui mɛ. A xa xɔnɛ kui, a naxa a rakali, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />«Yi mixi kobi yo mu soma yi bɔxi fanyi ma, n naxan laayidixi wo babae bɛ <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />fo Kalebi, Yefune xa di. A tan a toma nɛ. A bɔxi dɛnnaxɛ ɲɛrɛxi, na findima nɛ a gbe nun a bɔnsɔɛ gbe ra, barima a bara bira n tan Alatala xa kira fɔxɔ ra.»›»<verse eid="DEU 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />«Wo tan xa fe ra Alatala bara xɔnɔ n fan ma. A naxa a masen, ‹I tan yɛtɛ yati mu soma yi bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Yosuwe, Nunu xa di, i malima, nan fama sode. Limaniya fi a ma, barima a tan nan tima Isirayilakae ya ra yi bɔxi masɔtɔfe ra, a xa findi e kɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Wo xa die, wo a falaxi naxee bɛ, e findima geelimanie ra. E tan naxan mu fe kobi nun fe fanyi tagi raba kolonxi, e tan nan fama sode na bɔxi ma. N fama na bɔxi fide e tan nan ma. A findima e tan nan gbe ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Kɔnɔ wo tan man xa wo mafindi gbilenfe ra gbengberenyi biri ra, sigafe Kale baa mabiri.›»<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />«Wo naxa a yaabi, ‹Muxu bara findi yunubitɔɛ ra Alatala ya i, kɔnɔ yakɔsi muxu fa wama sigafe gere sode nɛ, alɔ muxu Marigi Alatala muxu yamarixi a ra ki naxɛ.› Kankan naxa geresose tongo, barima wo a maɲɔxun nɛ a yi geya taa masɔtɔfe a findima sɔɔnɛya ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Na nan a to Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, ‹A fala e bɛ, wo naxa siga gere sode de, barima n mu na wo ya ma. Wo naxa siga de, wo yaxuie naxa fa wo bɔnbɔ.› <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />N yi marasi fixi nɛ wo ma, kɔnɔ wo mu tin wo tuli matide n na. Wo naxa Alatala xui matandi, wo naxa te yɛtɛ igboɲa kui geya fari. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Na tɛmui Amorika naxee nu sabatixi geya fari e naxa mini wo gerede alɔ kumi dinma mixi ra ki naxɛ. E naxa wo bɔnbɔ keli Seyiri han Horoma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Wo to gbilen, wo naxa wa Alatala ya i, kɔnɔ Alatala mu a tuli mati wo wa xui ra. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Wo man naxa lu Kadesi, wo bu naa alɔ wo singe bui naxan naba.»<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s">Isirayilakae taae mabilinfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />«Na xanbi won naxa gbilen gbengberenyi kira suxu ra sigafe Kale Baa mabiri, alɔ Alatala a masen n bɛ ki naxɛ. Won naxa xi wuyaxi raba Seyiri geyae rabilinyi.»<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />«Alatala naxa a fala n bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />‹Wo bara yi geya mabilin a gbe ra. Wo wo mafindi sigafe ra kɔɔla ma.› <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />A naxa a fala n bɛ n xa yi yaamari fi wo ma. Wo fama dangide Seyiri bɔxi sɛɛti ma, wo ngaxakerenyie na dɛnnaxɛ, Esayu bɔnsɔɛ. E fama nɛ gaaxude wo ya ra, kɔnɔ wo wo yɛtɛ masuxu e gerefe ra, <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />barima n mu sese soma wo yi ra e xa bɔxi ma, hali sanyi tide. N bara Seyiri geyae fi Esayu ma. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Wo na wa donse nun ye naxan xɔn fo wo a sara e ma gbeti ra. <verse eid="DEU 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />Wo Marigi Alatala bara baraka sa wo wali fɔxi. A bara a ɲɔxɔ sa wo xa fe xɔn ma wo nu yi gbengberenyi igirima tɛmui naxɛ. Yi ɲɛ tongo naani bun ma, wo birin nan nu a ra. Sese xa fe mu xɔrɔxɔ wo ma.»<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />«Won naxa dangi won ngaxakerenyie ra yire makuye, Esayu bɔnsɔɛ naxan sabatixi Seyiri bɔxi ma. Won man naxa dangi Araba, Elata, Esiyon Geberi kira ra yire makuye. Na xanbi won naxa won mafindi, won Mowaba gbengberenyi kira suxu.»<verse eid="DEU 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />«Alatala naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹Wo naxa gere giri Mowabakae ma de. Wo naxa gere ti e bɛ de, barima n mu fama sese sode wo yi ra e xɔnyi. N bara Ari bɔxi fi Loti ma.›»<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Singe ra, Emikae nan nu na Ari bɔxi ma. Ɲama gbangbalanyi nan nu e ra. E wuya, e fan kuya alɔ Anaki bɔnsɔɛe. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Mixi ndee naxa e maɲɔxun Refakae ra, naxee maniya Anaki bɔnsɔɛe ra, kɔnɔ Mowabakae nu e xilima nɛ Emikae. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Naxan findi Seyiri bɔxi ra, Xorikae nan singe nu na naa. Esayu bɔnsɔɛ naxa e masuxu, e e faxa. E tan naxa sabati naa. Isirayilakae fan fama na mɔɔli nan nabade bɔxi ma Alatala na dɛnnaxɛ fi e ma.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />«Alatala naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹Yakɔsi, wo keli, wo xa Serede xure igiri.›» Won naxa na raba. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Ɲɛ tongo saxan nun solomasaxan dangi nɛ kabi won keli lɔxɔɛ Kadesi Barineya han won giri lɔxɔɛ Serede xure ra. Na waxati kui geresoe naxee nu na, nee birin nu bara faxa alɔ Alatala a rakali e bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Alatala naxa e tuxunsan han e birin naxa halaki.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Na geresoe to bara halaki ɲama tagi, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />«Wo fa sigafe dangide Mowaba naaninyi nan na sigafe Ari bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Wo makɔrɛma nɛ Amonikae ra. Wo naxa gere giri e ma de. Wo naxa e fen gere ra, barima n mu fama sese sode wo yi ra e xa bɔxi ma. N naa fixi Loti bɔnsɔɛ nan ma.»<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />E nu yi bɔxi maɲɔxunxi Refakae nan gbe ra. Kabi tɛmui xɔnnakuye Refakae nan nu sabatixi naa. Amonikae nu e xilima nɛ Samisumikae. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Ɲama sɛnbɛma nan nu lanxi e ma, e wuya, e man gbangbalan alɔ Anaki bɔnsɔɛ. Kɔnɔ Alatala naxa e halaki Amonikae saabui ra. Naa naxa findi Amonikae gbe ra, e naxa sabati naa. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Alatala naxa na mɔɔli raba Esayu xa die bɛ naxee sabatixi Seyiri bɔxi ma. A to nu Xorikae halakima e saabui ra, naa naxa findi e gbe ra. E sabatixi mɛnni nɛ han yakɔsi. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Naxan findi Awikae tan na, naxee nu sabatixi taae kui han Gasa, e naxa halaki Kafatorokae saabui ra. Naa naxa findi Kafatorokae gbe ra, e naxa sabati naa. Kafatorokae naxa keli Kafatoro.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />Alatala naxa a masen won bɛ, «Wo ti kira xɔn ma, wo xa Arinon xure igiri. Wo a mato, n bara Sixɔn Amorika Xɛsibɔn mangɛ so wo yi ra nun a xa bɔxi. Yakɔsi, wo na tongo, wo e gere. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />To n fama nɛ wo xa fe magaaxui lude duniɲa mixi birin ma. E na wo xili mɛ, e fama nɛ sɛrɛnde gbirigbiri.»<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sixɔn mangɛya sɔtɔ ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />«N xɛɛra xɛɛ nɛ Sixɔn, Xɛsibɔn mangɛ ma, kelife ra Kedemoti gbengberenyi ma. N naxa yi bɔɲɛsa masenyi ti a bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />‹Muxu wama i xa bɔxi igirife. Muxu muxu ɲɛrɛma kira nan tun xɔn ma. Muxu mu sigama kɔɔla ma, muxu mu sigama yirefanyi ma. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Muxu donse nun ye naxan minma, muxu fama nɛ a birin sare fide i ma gbeti ra. A lu kansan muxu xa dangi i xa bɔxi ma muxu sanyi ra. <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />Esayu bɔnsɔɛe naxee sabatixi Seyiri bɔxi ma, nun Mowabakae naxee sabatixi Ari bɔxi ma, nee naxa muxu sagoe sa dangife ra e xa bɔxi ma. I fan xa muxu sagoe sa muxu xa Yurudɛn xure igiri, muxu xa so bɔxi ma muxu Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fixi muxu ma.› <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Kɔnɔ Xɛsibɔn mangɛ Sixɔn naxa tondi muxu sagoe fide dangife ra a xa bɔxi ma, barima wo Marigi Alatala nu bara a xaxili raxɔrɔxɔ. A naxa a bɔɲɛ balan alako a xa a so wo yi ra alɔ wo a toxi ki naxɛ to.»<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />«Alatala naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹I bara a to, n bara gɛ Sixɔn nun a xa bɔxi sode i yi ra. Naa tongo i gbe.› <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Sixɔn nun a xa ɲama birin naxa keli fafe ra won gerede Yahasi. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Won Marigi Alatala naxa e so won yi ra xunnakeli kui. Won naxa nɔla sɔtɔ e ma, a tan, a xa die a nun a xa ɲama birin. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Won naxa na taae birin suxu, won naxa e birin kana. Won man naxa xɛmɛe, nun ginɛe, a nun dimɛe birin faxa. Won mu mixi yo lu a ɲiɲɛ ra, <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />kɔnɔ won mu sese tongo fo xurusee a nun se xɔri naxee nu na na taae kui. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Keli Aroweri Arinon xure dɛ ra, a nun taa naxan na geya lanbanyi, sigafe ra han Galadi, taa yo sɛnbɛ mu dangi won na. Won Marigi Alatala naxa a birin so won yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Kɔnɔ wo mu wo makɔrɛ Amonikae xa bɔxi ra, Yaboko xure dɛ birin, taa naxee na geya fari, a nun Alatala tɔnyi dɔxɔ won ma bɔxi naxee gerefe ra.»<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Basan bɔxi masɔtɔ ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />«Won naxa won mafindi tefe ra Basan kira xɔn ma. Ogo, Basan mangɛ, naxa mini won gerede Ederi, a tan nun a xa ɲama birin. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Alatala naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹I naxa gaaxu a ya ra, barima n a niyama nɛ i xutu sɔtɔ a tan nun a xa ɲama birin ma nun a xa bɔxi. I xa nɔ a ra alɔ i a rabaxi Amorikae xa mangɛ Sixɔn na ki naxɛ.› <verse eid="DEU 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Won Marigi Alatala naxa a niya won xa xutu sɔtɔ Basan mangɛ Ogo nun a xa ɲama birin ma. Won naxa e birin faxa, mixi yo mu lu. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Na tɛmui won nu bara e xa taae birin suxu. Na taa yo mu lu won mu dɛnnaxɛ suxu, taa tongo senni na a ra naxan na Aragobo rabilinyi. Na taa birin nu na Ogo xa mangɛya nan bun ma Basan bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Na taae birin nu rabilinxi tɛtɛ itexie nan na, nun naadɛ mabalanxie ra. Taa gbegbe fan nu na tɛtɛ mu nu naxee rabilinxi. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Won naxa na longori taa birin kana alɔ won a raba Xɛsibɔn, Sixɔn mangɛ xa bɔxi ra ki naxɛ. Won naxa xɛmɛe, nun ginɛe, a nun dimɛe birin faxa, <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />kɔnɔ won naxa e xa xurusee nun e harige tan xanin.»<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />«Won a raba na ki nɛ. Na waxati won naxa bɔxie rasuxu, naxee nu na Yurudɛn sogetede biri, Amorikae xa mangɛ firinyie yi ra. Na longori keli Arinon xure han Xerimon geya. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Sidɔnkae na geya xili falama nɛ Siriyon. Amorikae tan na xili falama Seniri. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Taa naxee birin na lanbanyi ma, won naxa e birin masɔtɔ, a nun Galadi bɔxi rabilinyi birin, sigafe ra Basan ma sa dɔxɔ Salika nun Ederi ra. Na taa birin nu na Ogo xa mangɛya nan bun ma Basan bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Basan mangɛ Ogo nan keren mu faxa Refakae ya ma. A xa wure sade nu na Raaba nɛ, Amonikae xa mangataa. A kuyɛ nu sigaxi nɔngɔn solomanaani, a igboe nɔngɔn naani.»<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Galadi nun Basan bɔxi itaxunyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />«Na tɛmui won naxa xutu sɔtɔ na bɔxi ma. Kelife Aroweri sigafe ra Arinon xure ma, a nun Galade geya sɛɛti, nun a taae, n naxa na birin so Ruben nun Gadi bɔnsɔɛ yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />N naxa Galade sɛɛti dɔnxɔɛ nun Ogo xa mangɛya naxan na Basan bɔxi ma so Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti yi ra. Aragobo rabilinyi nun Basan nu kolonxi Refakae xa bɔxi nan na. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Manasi xa di Yayiri naxa Aragobo bɔxi findi a gbe ra, han Gesurikae nun Maakakae naaninyi ra. A naxa a xili sa Basan xun ma, naxan xili falama han yakɔsi Yayiri taa. <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />N naxa Galade so Makiri yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />N naxa Galade sɛɛti so Ruben bɔnsɔɛ a nun Gadi bɔnsɔɛ yi ra, han a sa dɔxɔ Arinon xure ra. Xure nan na naaninyi ra, han a sa dɔxɔ Yaboko xure ra Amonikae naaninyi ra, <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />a nun Araba bɔxi naxan nun Yurudɛn naaninyi baxi, keli Kinereti Baa ma, a sa dɔxɔ Araba Fɔxɛ Baa ra, naxan na Pisiga lanbanyi ma sogetede.»<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />«Na tɛmui n naxa yi yaamari fi wo ma, ‹Wo Marigi Alatala bara yi bɔxi fi wo ma alako a xa findi wo gbe ra. Wo tan xɛmɛ kɛndɛe, wo findima nɛ wo ngaxakerenyi Isirayilakae xa sɔɔrie ra. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Wo xa ginɛe nun wo xa diyɔrɛe, nun wo xa xurusee nan gbansan fama lude taae kui n naxee soxi wo yi ra. N na a kolon xurusee gbegbe na wo yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Wo sɔɔriɲa rabama nɛ han wo Marigi Alatala malabui fima wo ngaxakerenyie ma tɛmui naxɛ. Wo Marigi Alatala bɔxi fima e ma Yurudɛn naakiri nan ma. Na tɛmui kankan fama gbilende a xa bɔxi ma n naxan soxi a yi ra.›»<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />«Na tɛmui n naxa yaamari so Yosuwe yi ra. N fa a fala a bɛ, ‹I ya bara fee birin to i Marigi Alatala naxee rabaxi yi mangɛ firinyie ra. Alatala fama nɛ na rabade mangataa birin i na dangi dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />I naxa gaaxu e ya ra, barima i Marigi Alatala nan fama e gerede wo bɛ.›»<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annabi Munsa mu soma Kanaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />«Na tɛmui n naxa Alatala maxandi, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‹N Marigi Alatala, i bara i xa fisamanteya nun i sɛnbɛ masen i xa konyi bɛ. Ala gbɛtɛ yo mu na koore ma a nun bɔxi naxan nɔma i fɔxi a nun i xa kaabanakoe rabade. <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />N bara i mayandi, a lu n xa nɔ Yurudɛn xure igiride, alako n xa na bɔxi fanyi nun a xa geya fanyie to naxan na naakiri ma, a nun Liban.› <verse eid="DEU 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />Kɔnɔ wo tan xa fe ra, Alatala naxa xɔnɔ n ma. A mu n danxun. Alatala naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹A mu lan i xa yi wɔyɛnyi fala n bɛ sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Te Pisiga geya xuntagi, i xa sogegorode biri, kɔɔla biri, yirefanyi biri, a nun sogetede biri mato, kɔnɔ i xa a kolon a fanyi ra i mu Yurudɛn igirima. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />I xa yaamari so Yosuwe yi ra, i xa limaniya nun sɛnbɛ fi a ma, barima a tan nan fama tide ɲama ya ra Yurudɛn igirife ra. I bɔxi naxan toma, Yosuwe fama nɛ na bɔxi sode Isirayila yi ra, a findi e kɛ bɔxi ra.› <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Na nan a toxi, won naxa lu gulunba Beti Peyori yatagi.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa sɛriyɛ rabafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />«Yakɔsi, Isirayila, wo wo tuli mati. Wo xa bira sɛriyɛ nun yaamari fɔxɔ ra n wo xaranfe naxee ra yi ki, alako wo xa simaya sɔtɔ, wo man xa bɔxi sɔtɔ wo babae Marigi Alatala naxan fixi wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Wo naxa sese sa yaamari xun, n naxan falaxi wo bɛ. Wo man naxa sese ba a ra. Wo xa wo Marigi Alatala xa yaamari rawali alɔ n na falaxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />«Wo yae bara fee to Alatala naxee rabaxi Peyori. Wo Marigi Alatala bara mixi birin faxa naxee Bali batuxi Peyori. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Kɔnɔ wo tan naxee biraxi wo Marigi Alatala xa fe fɔxɔ ra, wo birin man na simaya kui han to.»<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />«Wo a kolon, n bara wo xaran sɛriyɛ nun yaamari ra alɔ n Marigi Alatala a yamarixi n na ki naxɛ, alako wo xa a raba bɔxi ma dɛnnaxɛ findima wo gbe ra. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Wo xa a ti xɔri ma, wo xa a raba, a xa findi lɔnni ra wo bɛ, a xa xaxili fi wo ma. Si gbɛtɛe na yi sɛriyɛe kolon, e fama nɛ a falade, ‹Yi si findixi lɔnnila fanyie nan na.› <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />Si mundun xa ala makɔrɛxi a ra alɔ won Marigi Alatala a makɔrɛma won na ki naxɛ won na a maxandi tɛmui naxɛ? <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Sɛriyɛ nun yaamari tinxinxi na si mundun bɛ alɔ won ma sɛriyɛ n naxan soxi wo yi ra yi ki? <verse eid="DEU 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Wo xa fee ragata wo xaxili ma lɔxɔɛ birin wo xa simaya kui, wo naxee toxi. Wo naxa nɛɛmu nee ma, e naxa ba wo bɔɲɛ ma. Wo xa e masen wo xa die nun wo xa mamadie bɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />«Wo wo maɲɔxun lɔxɔɛ ma wo ti wo Marigi Alatala ya i lɔxɔɛ naxɛ, Xorebe geya fari. Na lɔxɔɛ Alatala naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹Ɲama birin xa malan n yire. N xa n ma sɛriyɛ fala e bɛ alako e xa gaaxu n ya ra e xa duniɲɛigiri kui. E man xa a xaran e xa die fan na.› <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Wo naxa wo maso geya bunyi ra. Tɛ nu bara din geya ra han koore ma. Dimi, nuxui, nun kunda naxa goro. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Alatala naxa wɔyɛn wo bɛ tɛ tagi. Wo naxa a wɔyɛn xui mɛ, kɔnɔ wo mu sese to. Wo nu a xui nan tun mɛma. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />A naxa a xa saatɛ masen wo bɛ, wo naxan nawalima. A naxa na yaamari fu sɛbɛ gɛmɛ walaxɛ firinyi ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Na waxati, Alatala naxa n yaamari n xa wo xaran sɛriyɛ nun yaamari ra, alako wo xa a raba bɔxi ma naxan findima wo gbe ra.»<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />«Wo naxa wo yɛtɛ ranɛɛmu lɔxɔɛ ma de Alatala wɔyɛn wo bɛ lɔxɔɛ naxɛ, Xorebe geya fari tɛ tagi, wo mu a gundi yati to. <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />Wo naxa findi yunubitɔɛ ra de kuyee yailanfe ra, naxee misaalixi xɛmɛ, ginɛ, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />sube, xɔni, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />bubusee nun yɛxɛe ra naxee na ye ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Wo naxa wo yae rate koore ma de, soge batufe ra, xa na mu a ra kike, xa na mu a ra tunbuie. Se naxee birin na koore ma, wo naxa wo igoro e bɛ, wo naxa e batu. Wo Marigi Alatala nee daaxi si birin nan bɛ, naxee na duniɲa ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Kɔnɔ wo tan, Alatala wo ramini nɛ fe xɔrɔxɔɛ kui Misira bɔxi ma alako wo xa findi a xa ɲama ra, alɔ wo na ki naxɛ to lɔxɔɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />«Alatala naxa xɔnɔ n ma wo xa fe ra. A naxa a kali a n mu Yurudɛn igirima, n mu fama sode yi bɔxi fanyi ma wo Marigi Alatala naxan fixi wo ma kɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />N tan, n fama faxade yi bɔxi nan ma. N mu fama Yurudɛn igiride feo. Kɔnɔ wo tan fama nɛ a igiride, na bɔxi fanyi findi wo gbe ra. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Wo xa wo ɲɛngi sa wo yɛtɛ xɔn ma alako wo naxa nɛɛmu wo Marigi Alatala xa saatɛ ma a naxan tongoxi wo bɛ. Wo naxa kuye yo yailan wo Marigi Alatala naxee ratɔnxi wo ma, <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />barima wo Marigi Alatala luma alɔ tɛ naxan se kanama, a mu wama a firin boore xɔn ma.»<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />«Wo na die nun mamadie sɔtɔ tɛmui naxɛ, wo na bu ki naxɛ bɔxi ma, xa wo kuye yailan se nde misaali ra, xa wo fe ɲaaxi raba wo Marigi Alatala ya i naxan mu rafan a ma, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />koore nun bɔxi nan na won seede ra to lɔxɔɛ, wo fama nɛ faxade mafuren bɔxi ma naxan fama findide wo gbe ra Yurudɛn naakiri ma. Wo mu fama simaya sɔtɔde, wo halakima nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Alatala wo rayensenma nɛ ɲamanɛe ma. Wo si fama nɛ xurunde ɲamae tagi Alatala na wo xanin dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Mɛnni wo fama kuyee nan batude, mixie naxee yailanxi wuri ra, xa na mu a ra gɛmɛ, kuye naxee mu nɔma se tode, e mu fe mɛma, e mu e dɛgema, e mu se xiri mɛma. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Mɛnni wo fama nɛ wo Marigi Alatala fende. Wo a toma nɛ xa wo a fen wo bɔɲɛ fanyi ra, wo ɲanige birin na. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Wo xa tɔɔrɛ kui na fe birin wo lima nɛ. Na tɛmui wo fama gbilende wo Marigi Alatala ma, wo a xui mɛma nɛ, <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />barima wo Marigi Alatala, Ala na a ra naxan kinikinima mixi ma, naxan mu wo rabɛɲinma, naxan mu wo halakima. A mu fama nɛɛmude saatɛ ma a rakali naxan na wo babae bɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />«Wo wo maɲɔxun fe forie ma naxee bara dangi duniɲa ma kabi Ala adama daaxi tɛmui naxɛ. Fe kaabanakoe gbɛtɛ fan bara raba na xanbi ra? Nde bara na fe mɔɔli maniyɛ mɛ sinden? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Ɲama gbɛtɛ nde na na ba, naxee bara Ala xui mɛ tɛ tagi, a man fa simaya sɔtɔ alɔ naxan bara raba wo tan bɛ? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Ala mundun bara ɲama ba ɲama gbɛtɛ yi ra ɲaxankatɛ ra, tɔnxuma ra, kaabanakoe ra, gere belebele ra, fe magaaxuxie ra, alɔ wo Marigi Alatala naxan naba wo bɛ Misira bɔxi ma wo ya xɔri?»<verse eid="DEU 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />«Na bara fiixɛ wo bɛ alako wo xa la a ra a Alatala keren peti nan Ala ra, Ala gbɛtɛ yo mu na fo a keren. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />A naxa a xui ramini koore ma alako wo xa gaaxu a ya ra. A naxa tɛ belebele masen wo bɛ bɔxi fari, a wɔyɛn wo bɛ a tagi. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />A naxa wo babae xanu, a naxa e bɔnsɔɛ fan sugandi hali e dangi xanbi. Na nan a toxi a wo raminixi sɛnbɛ ra Misira bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />A sie keri wo bɛ naxee sɛnbɛ gbo wo tan bɛ, a e xa bɔxi so wo yi ra kɛ ra alɔ wo a toxi ki naxɛ to. <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Wo lan nɛ wo xa a kolon to lɔxɔɛ wo bɔɲɛ kui, a Alatala keren peti nan na Ala ra koore nun bɔxi ma. Ala gbɛtɛ mu na na fo a keren. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Wo a xa sɛriyɛ nun a xa yaamari rabatu, n naxan sofe wo yi ra to lɔxɔɛ, alako wo xa hɛɛri sɔtɔ wo tan nun wo bɔnsɔɛ, hali wo dangi xanbi, alako wo man xa simaya xɔnkuye sɔtɔ bɔxi ma wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fixi wo ma abadan.»<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mixi ratanga taae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Annabi Munsa naxa taa saxan sugandi Yurudɛn sogetede biri. <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />Nee naxa findi mixi ratanga taae ra faxatie bɛ naxee faxɛ tima, kɔnɔ e mu a ɲanigexi. Na faxɛti nɔma lude yi taa keren keren na ma kui alako a nii xa ratanga gbeɲɔxɔɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Na taae findi Beteseri nan na gbengberenyi ma geya fari, Rubenkae xɔnyi, Ramoti taa naxan na Galede, Gadikae xɔnyi, a nun Golan, taa naxan na Basan bɔxi ma Manasikae xɔnyi.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annabi Munsa xa masenyi firin nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Ala xa sɛriyɛ nan ya, Annabi Munsa naxan masenxi Isirayilakae bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Masenyi, sɛriyɛ, nun yaamari nan ya, Annabi Munsa naxan fala Isirayilakae bɛ e nu minima Misira bɔxi ra tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />Na tɛmui, e nu na Yurudɛn naakiri nan ma, gulunba Beti Peyori ya tagi, Amorikae xa mangɛ Sixɔn xa bɔxi ma. Sixɔn nu sabatixi Xɛsibɔn nɛ. Annabi Munsa nun Isirayilakae to mini Misira bɔxi ma, e naxa nɔla sɔtɔ Sixɔn ma. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />E naxa a xa bɔxi rasuxu a yi ra, a nun Basan mangɛ Ogo xa bɔxi. Yi Amorikae xa mangɛ firinyie nu na Yurudɛn naakiri ma sogetede biri. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Yi taae nu sigaxi Aroweri han Arinon xure, sigafe ra Xerimon geya ma, naxan xili Siyon. <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />Yi taae nan nu Araba bɔxi ma Yurudɛn naakiri ma, sogetede biri, a sa dɔxɔ Araba baa ra Pisiga geya bun ma.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Yaamari fu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Annabi Munsa naxa Isirayila ɲama maxili, a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Isirayilakae, wo wo tuli mati yi sɛriyɛ nun yaamari ra, n naxan falafe wo bɛ to lɔxɔɛ. Wo lan wo xa a xaran, wo xa fɛntɛn a raba ki ma. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Won Marigi Alatala bara saatɛ tongo won bɛ Xorebe geya fari. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Alatala nun won babae xa mu yi saatɛ xirixi. A xirixi won tan nan birin tagi, won tan naxee na simaya kui yi waxati. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Alatala wɔyɛn nɛ won bɛ ya nun ya tɛ tagi geya fari. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Na tɛmui n tan nan nu na wo nun Alatala tagi alako n xa Alatala xa masenyi ya xaran wo bɛ, barima wo nu gaaxuxi tɛ ya ra. Wo mu te geya fari. A naxa a masen wo bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />‹N tan nan na wo Marigi Alatala ra. N tan nan wo raminixi Misira, wo nu na konyiya kui dɛnnaxɛ.›»<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />«Wo naxa Ala gbɛtɛ batu fo n keren.»<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />«Wo naxa kuye yailan misaali yo ra, se yo ra naxee na koore nun bɔxi ma, naxee na ye bun ma. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Wo naxa wo igoro e bɛ de, wo naxa e batu de, barima n tan nan na wo Marigi Alatala ra, n mu wama n firin boore xɔn. Xa mixi nde n matandi, n na kanyi ɲaxankatama nɛ, a tan nun a bɔnsɔɛ han a sa dɔxɔ a tolobitɛe ra, xa na mu a ra a tolontolonyie ra naxee na n naɲaaxu. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Kɔnɔ n fe fanyi rabama nɛ bɔnsɔɛ wulu bɛ n nafan naxee ma, naxee n ma sɛriyɛ rabatuma.»<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />«Wo naxa wo Marigi Alatala xili yelefu, barima Alatala mixi ɲaxankatama nɛ naxan na rabama.»<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />«Wo lan nɛ wo xa fɛntɛn malabui lɔxɔɛ ma, wo xa a binya alɔ wo Marigi Alatala a yamarixi wo bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Xi senni nan na wo bɛ lɔxɔxunyi kui wali lɔxɔɛe ra, wo xa wali birin nabafe ra. <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />A xi solofere nde findixi wo Marigi Alatala xa malabui lɔxɔɛ nan na. Wo naxa wali yo raba na lɔxɔɛ keli wo tan ma, a sa wo xa die li, wo xa konyie, wo xa ningee, wo xa sofalee, wo xa xuruse mɔɔli birin, han a sa wo xa xɔɲɛe li naxee na wo xɔnyi, alako wo xa konyie fan xa e malabu alɔ wo tan. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Wo naxa nɛɛmu konyi nan nu wo ra Misira. N naxa wo ramini na konyiya kui, a keli n sɛnbɛ ma. N a falaxi wo bɛ na nan ma, wo xa malabui lɔxɔɛ binya.»<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />«Wo xa wo baba nun wo nga binya alɔ wo Marigi Alatala a yamarixi wo bɛ ki naxɛ, alako wo xa simaya xɔnkuye nun sɛɛwɛ sɔtɔ bɔxi ma wo Marigi Alatala naxan fima wo ma.»<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />«Wo naxa faxɛ ti.»<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />«Wo naxa yɛnɛ raba.»<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />«Wo naxa muɲɛ ti.»<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />«Wo naxa wule seedeɲɔxɔya raba wo boore xun.»<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />«Wo naxa mila wo boore xa ginɛ ma, a xa banxi, a xa xɛ, a xa konyi, a xa ninge, a xa sofale, nun se naxan birin findixi a gbe ra.»<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />«Alatala yi fee nan masen wo xa malanyi kui, a xui itexi ra, geya fari, tɛ tagi, nuxui nun kunda tagi. A mu sese sa a xun ma. A naxa e sɛbɛ gɛmɛ walaxɛ firin ma, a e so n yi ra.»<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />«Wo yi xui mɛ kuye ifɔɔrɛ kui tɛmui naxɛ, tɛ tagi, geya fari, wo naxa wo maso n na, wo nun wo xa mangɛe nun kuntigie. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Wo naxa a fala, ‹Muxu Marigi Alatala bara a xa nɔrɛ nun a xa gboe masen muxu bɛ. Muxu bara a xui mɛ wɔyɛn na tɛ tagi. Muxu bara a kolon to a Ala nɔma wɔyɛnde mixi bɛ, na kanyi man fa lu a mu faxa. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Yakɔsi, muxu fa muxu makɔrɛma faxɛ ra munfe ra? Yi tɛ muxu faxama nɛ. Xa muxu man muxu tuli mati won Marigi Alatala xui ra, muxu faxama nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Mixi mundun luxi alɔ won tan naxan bara Alatala xui mɛ a wɔyɛnma tɛ tagi, na kanyi man fa lu a mu faxa? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />I tan Munsa, i maso won Marigi Alatala ra, i xa i tuli mati a xa masenyi ra, alako i xa na madangi muxu bɛ, muxu muxu tuli matima nɛ i ra, muxu man fa a xui rabatu.›»<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />«Alatala naxa wo xa wɔyɛnyi mɛ, wo naxan falaxi n bɛ. A naxa a masen n bɛ, ‹N bara ɲama fala xui mɛ. E naxan birin falaxi nɔndi na a ra. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Xa n ma fe gaaxui lu e bɔɲɛ ma tɛmui birin, e man naxa n ma yaamari rabatu, e tan nun e bɔnsɔɛ fama nɛ hɛɛri sɔtɔde abadan. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Siga i xa sa a fala e bɛ, e xa so e xa kiri banxie bun ma. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Kɔnɔ i tan xa lu n fɛ ma be. N xa n ma sɛriyɛ nun yaamari birin masen i bɛ, i lan i xa e xaran naxan na, alako e xa nɔ na raɲɛrɛde bɔxi ma n fama dɛnnaxɛ fide e ma.› <verse eid="DEU 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />Wo Marigi Alatala naxan masenxi wo bɛ, wo xa wo tuli mati na ra, wo man xa a rabatu. Wo naxa siga kɔɔla ma, wo naxa siga yirefanyi ma. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Wo xa bira yi kira fanyi nan fɔxɔ ra won Marigi Alatala naxan masenxi, alako wo naxa faxa, wo fa simaya xɔnkuye sɔtɔ sɛɛwɛ kui bɔxi ma wo fama dɛnnaxɛ sɔtɔde.»<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa marafanyi nun a xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />«Sɛriyɛ, yaamari, nun masenyi nan yi ki, wo Marigi Alatala naxan soxi n yi ra alako n xa a xaran wo ra, wo xa nɔ a rabade bɔxi ma a fafe naxan fide wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Wo xa gaaxu won Marigi Alatala ya ra. Wo xa simaya kui, wo tan, wo xa die, a nun wo xa mamadie, wo xa yi sɛriyɛ nun yi yaamari birin naba n naxan soxi wo yi ra, alako wo xa simaya xɔnkuye sɔtɔ. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Isirayilakae, wo wo ɲɛngi sa yi birin xɔn ma, wo man xa fɛntɛn a raba ki ma. Wo fama nɛ hɛɛri sɔtɔde, wo fama nɛ findide ɲama gbegbe ra yi bɔxi ma xiɲɛ nun kumi gbegbe na dɛnnaxɛ, alɔ wo benbae Marigi Alatala a falaxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />Isirayilakae, wo wo tuli mati. Won Marigi Alatala keren peti na a ra. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Wo lan nɛ wo xa wo Marigi Alatala xanu wo bɔɲɛ fiixɛxi ra, wo nii ra, a nun wo sɛnbɛ birin na. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />N yi masenyi naxan xaranxi wo bɛ yi ki, a xa lu wo bɔɲɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Wo fama nɛ a mabanbande wo xa die bɛ tɛmui birin, xa wo na banxi kui, xa wo na biyaasife, kɔɛ nun yanyi ra. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />A xa xiri wo bɛlɛxɛ nun wo tigi ra tɔnxuma ra. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Wo xa a sɛbɛ wo xa banxi nun wo xa naadɛ ma.»<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />«Wo Marigi Alatala na wo xanin tɛmui naxɛ bɔxi ma a na dɛnnaxɛ sofe wo yi ra, alɔ a rakali wo babae Iburahima, Isiyaga, a nun Yaxuba bɛ ki naxɛ, wo fama nɛ taa belebele tofanyie sɔtɔde wo mu naxee tixi, <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />banxi rafexie harige mɔɔli birin na wo mu naxee fenxi, kɔlɔnyie wo mu naxee gexi, wɛni bilie nun oliwi bilie wo mu naxee sixi. <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />Wo na wo dɛge han wo naxa wasa tɛmui naxɛ, wo naxa nɛɛmu wo Marigi Alatala ma de, naxan wo raminixi konyiya kui Misira bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Wo xa gaaxu wo Marigi Alatala ya ra. Wo xa a keren nan batu. Wo xa wo kali a xili nan na. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Wo naxa ala gbɛtɛe batu de, mixie naxee batuma wo rabilinyi, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />barima wo Marigi Alatala mu wama a firin nde xɔn. Xa na mu a ra a xɔnɔma nɛ wo ma, a man fa wo faxa.»<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />«Wo naxa wo Marigi Alatala mato de, alɔ wo naxan naba Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Wo xa wo Marigi Alatala xa sɛriyɛ, a xa masenyi, nun a xa yaamari rabatu tinxinyi kui a naxan soxi wo yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Wo xa wo ɲɛrɛ tinxinyi kira ra. Alatala wama fe naxan birin xɔn ma, wo lan wo xa na nan naba. Na tɛmui wo fama nɛ hɛɛri sɔtɔde, wo fa bɔxi fanyi sɔtɔ Alatala a kali naxan na wo babae bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />Wo wo yaxuie kerima nɛ alɔ Alatala a masenxi ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />«Wo xa die na wo maxɔrin tɛmui naxɛ, ‹Munse na yi masenyi, yi sɛriyɛ, nun yi yaamari ra, won Marigi Alatala naxan soxi won yi ra yi ki?› <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Wo fama nɛ e yaabide, ‹Firawuna xa konyie nan nu muxu ra Misira bɔxi ma, Alatala fa muxu ramini naa a sɛnbɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Alatala naxa tɔnxuma nun kaabanako belebele magaaxuxie raba muxu ya xɔri Misirakae ra, Firawuna nun a xa denbaya birin na. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />A muxu ramini nɛ Misira alako a xa muxu xanin bɔxi ma, a a kali dɛnnaxɛ xa fe ra won babae bɛ sofe ra won yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Na tɛmui Alatala naxa muxu yaamari, a muxu xa yi sɛriyɛ birin nawali a rawali ki ma. Xa won gaaxu won Marigi Alatala ya ra, a hɛɛri nun simaya xɔnkuye fima nɛ won ma alɔ a na a rabafe ki naxɛ yakɔsi. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Xa won sa won Marigi Alatala xa yaamari birin nabatu alɔ a masenxi won bɛ ki naxɛ, na findima nɛ tinxinyi ra won bɛ.›»<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila nun Kanaankae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />«Wo Marigi Alatala na wo xanin bɔxi ma tɛmui naxɛ, a dɛnnaxɛ fima wo ma, a fama nɛ si solofere keride naxee findi Xitikae, Girigasakae, Amorikae, Kanaankae, Peresikae, Hiwikae nun Yebusukae ra, si solofere naxee sɛnbɛ gbo wo bɛ, e man wuya wo bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Wo Marigi Alatala na e lu wo sagoe tɛmui naxɛ, wo xutu sɔtɔma nɛ e ma, wo e halaki. Wo naxa saatɛ xiri wo tagi, wo man naxa kinikini e ma. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Wo nun e tan naxa futi malan de. Wo naxa wo xa di ginɛe fi e xa di xɛmɛe ma, wo naxa ginɛe fan fen e ra wo xa di xɛmɛe bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Xa na mu a ra yi xɔɲɛe fama nɛ wo xa die ratantande, e xa ala gbɛtɛe batu. Alatala xɔnɔma nɛ wo ma na tɛmui, a man fa wo faxa mafurenyi ra. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Kira nan yi ki wo lan wo xa mini naxan na yi mixie bɛ. Wo xa e xa sɛrɛxɛbadee a nun e xa gɛmɛ batuxie birin kana. Wo xa e xa Asera wuri masolixie bolon, wo xa e xa kuye birin gan.»<verse eid="DEU 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />«Wo bara findi wo Marigi Alatala xa ɲama ra. Wo Marigi Alatala bara wo tan nan sugandi duniɲa ɲama tagi bɛndɛ fuɲi fari, alako wo xa findi a yɛtɛ yati gbe ra. <verse eid="DEU 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />Alatala mu wo sugandixi wo xa ɲama xasabi xa fe xa ra, barima wo xurun si birin bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Alatala wo tan nan sugandixi a xa xanunteya xa fe ra. A bara wa saatɛ rakamalife a naxan tongo wo benbae bɛ. Na nan a toxi a wo raminixi bɔxi ma a sɛnbɛ ra wo nu na konyiya kui dɛnnaxɛ. A naxa wo ba Firawuna yi ra, Misira mangɛ. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Wo xa a kolon wo Marigi Alatala, nan keren peti na Ala ra. Ala findixi Fonisire Mangɛ nan na naxan a xa saatɛ rakamalima, naxan hɛɛri gbegbe fima wo ma. A na rabama wo bɔnsɔɛe bɛ naxee fama wo xanbi ra, naxee a xanuma, e man a xa yaamarie rabatu. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Kɔnɔ a gbilenma nɛ mixie fɔxɔ ra naxee a xɔnma, a a xɔnnantee ralɔɛma nɛ keren na. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Wo xa fɛntɛn n ma yaamari nun n ma sɛriyɛ ma n naxan soxi wo yi ra to lɔxɔɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />«Xa wo wo ɲɛngi sa yi yaamari xɔn ma, wo naxa fɛntɛn a ma, wo Marigi Alatala fama a xa saatɛ rakamalide, a hɛɛri fima nɛ wo ma alɔ a rakalixi wo benbae bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />A wo xanuma nɛ, a barakɛ sa wo xa fe, a man wo rawuya. A di gbegbe barife ragiri wo ma. Wo fa bɔxi daxamui fan sɔtɔde, mɛngi, wɛni nɛɛnɛ nun ture. A man fa wo xa ningee nun wo xa xurusee rawuya. A yi birin nabama nɛ bɔxi ma, a rakali naxan na wo babae bɛ sofe ra wo yi. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />A wo barakama nɛ dangife si birin na. Dibaritare mu fama lude wo ya ma, xɛmɛ ba, ginɛ ba, xa na mu a ra xuruse. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Alatala wo ratangama nɛ fure dɔxɔɛ mɔɔli birin ma, a nun fe ɲaaxi birin ma wo naxee kolonxi Misira bɔxi ma. Kɔnɔ a yi fure rasanbama mixie nan ma naxee na wo raɲaaxu. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Wo lan nɛ wo xa mixi birin faxa, wo Marigi Alatala naxee soma wo yi ra. Wo naxa kinikini e ma, wo man naxa e xa alae batu, alako e naxa wo ratantan.»<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />«Wo fama a maɲɔxunde wo bɔɲɛ ma, ‹Yi sie gbo dangife won tan na. Won tan nɔla sɔtɔma nee ma di?› <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Kɔnɔ, wo naxa gaaxu e ya ra. Wo xa ratu wo Marigi Alatala naxan nabaxi Firawuna nun Misira bɔxi ra. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Wo bara fe xɔrɔxɔɛe to naxee dɔxɔxi e ma, tɔnxumae nun kaabanakoe naxee rabaxi. Wo bara wo Marigi Alatala sɛnbɛ to a wo ramini ki naxɛ Misira bɔxi ma. Na nan a toma wo Marigi Alatala na mɔɔli rabama ɲamanɛ birin na wo gaaxuxi naxee ya ra. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Wo Marigi Alatala fama nɛ wo yaxuie birin halakide, hali naxee nɔxunma wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Wo naxa gaaxu e ya ra, barima wo nun wo Marigi Alatala na a ra, Ala belebele naxan magaaxu.»<verse eid="DEU 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />«Wo Marigi Alatala fama nɛ yi ɲama keride a xuri xuri ra wo ya i. Wo mu nɔma e birin faxade waxati keren bun, xa na mu a ra wula i subee fama nɛ wuyade, e wo tɔɔrɔ. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Wo Marigi Alatala fama nɛ yi mixie sode wo yi ra. E ifuma nɛ kira ma, han e sa halaki. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />A fama nɛ e xa mangɛe sode wo yi ra, wo e xili ralɔɛ. Mixi yo mu nɔma tide wo kanke. Wo e birin halakima nɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />«Wo e xa ala yailanxie ganma nɛ. Wo naxa mila e xa xɛɛma nun gbeti ma naxan na kuyee ma. Wo naxa na findi wo gbe ra alako a naxa findi wo fan bɛ gantanyi ra, barima fe nan na ki wo Marigi Alatala naxan naharamuxi. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Wo naxa na kuye mɔɔli ɲaaxi raso wo xa banxi kui de, alako wo naxa halaki alɔ kuyee. Wo nee findima se ɲaaxi nan na barima a raharamuxi.»<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">Nɛɛmufe Alatala ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />«Wo xa yi yaamari birin naba n naxan xaranfe wo bɛ to lɔxɔɛ. Na nan fama a niyade wo xa simaya sɔtɔ, wo fa findi ɲama gbegbe ra. Na tɛmui, wo nɔma yi bɔxi sɔtɔde alɔ Alatala a rakalixi wo babae bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Wo xa wo maɲɔxun ɲɛrɛ xɔnkuye ma wo Marigi Alatala naxan nagiri wo ma yi gbengberenyi igirife ra yi ɲɛ tongo naani bun ma. A yi fe xɔrɔxɔɛe rabaxi nɛ wo ra, alako wo xa wo yɛtɛ magoro, a xa wo mato, a xa nɔ a kolonde fe naxan na wo sondonmɛ ma. A man xa nɔ a kolonde xa wo wama a xa sɛriyɛ mabanbanfe. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />A bara wo xa fe magoro, a bara wo raxi kaamɛ ra. A bara mana so wo yi ra, wo nun wo benbae mu donse naxan kolon. A a masen wo bɛ na ki nɛ, a ibunadama mu nɔma balode donse xa kansan xun na, kɔnɔ masenyi fan birin na naxan fatanxi Alatala ra. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Wo xa donmae mu ɲɔnxi, wo sanyie mu funtuxi yi ɲɛ tongo naani bun ma. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Wo lan nɛ wo xa a kolon a wo Marigi Alatala na wo xurufe nɛ alɔ baba a xa di xuruma ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Wo wo Marigi Alatala xa yaamari mabanban, wo xa wo yɛtɛ suxu alɔ a wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ, wo man xa gaaxu a ya ra.»<verse eid="DEU 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />«Wo Marigi Alatala wo rasoma nɛ bɔxi fanyi ma xuree nun dulonyie na dɛnnaxɛ. Ye gbegbe na na bɔxi bun ma, a man minima gulunba nun geya fari. <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />Bɔxi na a ra mɛngi, fundenyi maniyɛ, wɛni bili, xɔrɛ, kinkirinsi, oliwi, nun kumi na dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Taami mu ɲɔnma sɔnɔn, se birin fama nɛ lude wo yi ra. Wure fama nɛ minide gɛmɛe kui, wure gbeeli fan sɔtɔma nɛ geya kui.»<verse eid="DEU 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />«Wo na wo dɛge han wo naxa luga, wo xa wo Marigi Alatala tantu yi bɔxi fanyi xa fe ra. <verse eid="DEU 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Wo naxa wo yɛtɛ ranɛɛmu wo Marigi Alatala xa fe ma de, tondife a xa yaamari nun a xa sɛriyɛ rabatufe ra, n naxan xaranxi wo bɛ to lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Wo na wo dɛge han wo naxa luga, wo na banxie ti, wo naxa sabati e kui, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />wo xa xurusee xungbe nun a lanmae na wuya, wo xa gbeti nun wo xa xɛɛma na gbo, wo harige birin na gbo, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />wo xa fɛntɛn wo yɛtɛ ma a fanyi ra alako wo naxa wo yɛtɛ igbo han wo xa nɛɛmu wo Marigi Alatala ma, naxan wo raminixi Misira bɔxi ma konyiya kui. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />A bara wo radangi gbengberen yire magaaxuxi ra, bɔximase xɔnɛ kanyi nun tali na dɛnnaxɛ, ye mu na bɔxi naxan ma. A naxa ye ramini fanye kui. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />A naxa mana donse so wo yi ra gbengberenyi ma, wo benbae mu nu naxan kolon, alako a xa wo xa fe magoro, a xa wo mato, a fa nɔ fe fanyi rabade wo bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Wo naxa a maɲɔxun de a wo sɛnbɛ nun wo xa kɔɔta nan yi harige fixi wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Wo xa wo ratu wo Marigi Alatala ma, a tan nan yi sɛnbɛ fima wo ma, alako wo xa na harige birin sɔtɔ. A man bara saatɛ masen wo bɛ to lɔxɔɛ a naxan tongo a nun wo babae ra.»<verse eid="DEU 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />«Xa wo nɛɛmu wo Marigi Alatala ma, xa wo bira ala gbɛtɛe batufe fɔxɔ ra, xa wo tuubi e bɛ, xa wo wo magoro e bɛ, n xa a fala wo bɛ to lɔxɔɛ, wo halakima nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Iyo, wo halakima nɛ alɔ Alatala si gbɛtɛe halakixi ki naxɛ wo ya xɔri, barima wo mu wo tuli matixi wo Marigi Alatala xa masenyi ra.»<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Isirayilakae Ala matandife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />«Isirayilakae wo wo tuli mati. To lɔxɔɛ wo na sigafe Yurudɛn nan igiride. Wo fama nɛ sie ragide naxee gbo wo bɛ, e sɛnbɛ dangi wo ra. Wo fa e xa taae tongo naxee tɛtɛ itexi han. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Wo fama Anaki xa die nan masɔtɔde, mixi sɛnbɛmae naxee gbangbalan, wo naxee kolon a fanyi ra. Wo bara a mɛ, e a falama, ‹Nde nɔma tide Anaki xa die ya i?› <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Wo nɔma a kolonde yakɔsi, a wo Marigi Alatala na a ɲɛrɛfe wo ya ra, alɔ tɛ naxan se birin kanama. A tan nan yati e halakima, a e xa fe magoro wo ya xɔri. Wo e kerima nɛ, wo e birin halakima nɛ alɔ wo Marigi Alatala a masenxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />Wo Marigi Alatala na e keri wo ya ra tɛmui naxɛ, wo naxa wo yɛtɛ matɔxɔ de han wo xa a fala, ‹Alatala na a xɛɛxi muxu yi bɔxi masɔtɔxi muxu xa tinxinyi saabui ra.› E xa fe kobi raba na a toxi Alatala e kerixi beenun wo xa be li. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Wo naxa a maɲɔxun de a wo be sɔtɔxi wo xa tinxinyi nun wo xa fanyi nan ma. Alatala yi sie kerima e xa yuge kobi nan ma, a man xa natɛ rakamali a naxan tongo wo babae Iburahima, Isiyaga, nun Yaxuba bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Wo xa a kolon wo xa tinxinyi xa mu a niyaxi wo Marigi Alatala yi bɔxi fanyi soxi wo yi ra a xa findi wo gbe ra. Ɲama xurutare nan na wo ra.»<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />«Wo xa wo ratu a ma wo wo Marigi Alatala raxɔnɔ ki naxɛ gbengberenyi ma. Wo naxa nɛɛmu wo keli lɔxɔɛ ma Misira, han wo so lɔxɔɛ be, wo nu xurutareɲa rabama nɛ wo Marigi Alatala ra. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Wo Alatala raxɔnɔ nɛ Xorebe geya fari han a naxa wa wo faxafe. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />N to te geya fari alako n xa walaxɛ gɛmɛ daaxi tongo naxan findi saatɛ ra Alatala nun won tan tagi, n naxa yanyi tongo naani nun kɔɛ tongo naani raba geya fari, n mu taami don, n mu ye fan min. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Alatala naxa yi walaxɛ gɛmɛ daaxi firinyie so n yi ra, a naxan sɛbɛ a xɔnyɛ ra. Alatala naxan fala wo bɛ tɛ tagi, wo nu malanxi lɔxɔɛ naxɛ geya fari, na birin sɛbɛxi walaxɛ ma.»<verse eid="DEU 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />«Yi yanyi tongo naani nun yi kɔɛ tongo naani dangi xanbi, Alatala naxa yi walaxɛ gɛmɛ daaxi firinyi so n yi ra naxan findi saatɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Alatala naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹Keli, i xa goro mafuren barima i xa ɲama i naxan naminixi Misira bɔxi ra, e bara yangoe belebele raba, e bara e ba kira ma n naxan masen e bɛ, e bara kuye yailan wure raxunuxi ra.› <verse eid="DEU 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Alatala man naxa yi masen n bɛ, ‹N bara a to yi ɲama, ɲama xurutare na a ra. <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Keli be, n xa e halaki, n xa e xili ɲɔn duniɲa ma. N i mafindima ɲama gbegbe ra naxan sɛnbɛ gbo, e man wuya, dangi boore ɲama ra.› <verse eid="DEU 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />N naxa goro geya fari, naxan nu luxi alɔ a na tɛ nan tagi, na walaxɛ firinyie suxuxi n yi ra, Ala xa saatɛ sɛbɛxi naxee ma. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Na tɛmui n naxa a to wo bara yunubi fe raba wo Marigi Alatala ra. Wo ninge yailan wure raxunuxi ra. Wo wo ba kira ma Alatala naxan masen wo bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />N naxa yi walaxɛ gɛmɛ daaxi firinyie suxu n bɛlɛxɛ firinyi ra, n fa e wɔlɛ, e naxa ibɔɔ wo ya xɔri.»<verse eid="DEU 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />«N naxa bira bɔxi Alatala ya i alɔ n naxan naba a singe. N naxa lu naa yanyi tongo naani nun kɔɛ tongo naani, n mu taami don, n mu ye fan min. N na birin naba wo xa yunubi nan ma fe ra, naxan naɲaaxuxi Alatala ma, a a raxɔnɔ. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />N naxa gaaxu Alatala xa xɔnɛ ra a xɔnɔxi wo ma naxan ma han a wa wo halakife. Kɔnɔ Alatala man naxa n ma maxandi suxu. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />A bɔɲɛ nu texi Haruna nan ma a gbe ra han a wa a halakife, kɔnɔ n naxa Ala maxandi Haruna fan bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />N naxa ninge tongo wo naxan yailanxi, naxan findixi wo xa yunubi fe ra, n a woli tɛ xɔɔra, n a iwuru han a findi xube ra. N naxa na xube ibagan susui ye xɔɔra naxan kelima geya kɔn na.»<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />«Wo man bara Alatala raxɔnɔ Tabera, Masa, nun Kibiroti Hataawa. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Alatala to wo xɛɛ kelife Kadesi Barineya yi xɛɛraya ra, ‹Wo siga, wo xa bɔxi tongo n naxan soxi wo yi ra,› wo naxa wo Marigi Alatala xui matandi. Wo mu la a fala xui ra, wo mu na fan suxu nɔndi ra. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Kabi n naxa sa wo kolon, wo xurutare fe nan tun nabafe Alatala ra.»<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />«Alatala to wa wo faxafe, n naxa n felen bɔxi ma, n a maxandi yanyi tongo naani nun kɔɛ tongo naani bun ma. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />N naxa Alatala maxandi, ‹Marigi Alatala, i naxa i yɛtɛ xa ɲama halaki, i ɲama naxan xa xɔrɛya soxi a yi i xa gboe saabui ra, i naxan naminixi Misira bɔxi ma i sɛnbɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />I ratu i xa konyie ma, Iburahima, Isiyaga, nun Yaxuba. I naxa i kobe rato yi ɲama xa xaxili xɔrɔxɔya ma, e xa ɲaaxui, nun e xa yunubi ma, <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />alako Misirakae naxa a fala, «Alatala mu nɔma yi mixie xaninde bɔxi ma a dɛnnaxɛ laayidi tongoxi e bɛ. A e xɔnxi nɛ. A e ramini alako a xa sa e faxa gbengberenyi ma.» › <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Alatala i xa ɲama nan lanxi e ma. I gbe nan na e ra, i naxee xɔrɛyaxi i sɛnbɛ nun i xa mangɛya ra.»<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa xanunteya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />«Na tɛmui Alatala naxa yaamari fi n ma. A naxɛ, ‹Walaxɛ gɛmɛ daaxi firin yailan alɔ a singee nu ki naxɛ. I man xa kankira wuri daaxi yailan. Na tɛmui i xa fa n yire geya fari. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />N man gbilenma nɛ yi sɛriyɛ sɛbɛ ra naxan nu na boore walaxɛe ma, i naxee kanaxi. I fama e sade na kankira nan kui.› <verse eid="DEU 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />N naxa kankira yailan wuri mɔɔli nde ra naxan xɔrɔxɔ. N naxa walaxɛ gɛmɛ daaxi firin fan yailan naxan maniya booree ra. N naxa te e ra geya fari. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Alatala naxa sɛbɛli ti yi walaxɛ nɛɛnɛe ma, alɔ naxan singe nu sɛbɛxi booree ma. Yi yaamari fu, a naxee yaxaran wo bɛ geya fari tɛ tagi wo nu malanxi tɛmui naxɛ, Alatala naxa e so n yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />N naxa goro geya fari, n fa e sa kankira kui, n naxan yailanxi. E naxa lu naa alɔ Alatala a fala n bɛ ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Isirayilakae naxa keli Bene Yakan kɔlɔnyie ra sigafe ra Mosera. Haruna laaxira mɛnni nɛ, a naxa bɛndɛ sɔtɔ naa. A xa di Eleyasari naxa findi a ɲɔxɔɛ ra sɛrɛxɛdubɛɲa kui. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Na dangi xanbi Isirayilakae naxa siga Gudugoda. E to keli Gudugoda, e naxa siga Yotobata, xure gbegbe na bɔxi naxan ma. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Na waxati bun ma, Alatala naxa wali taxu Lewi bɔnsɔɛ ra, e xa findi kankira xaninyie ra, e xa ti Alatala ya i a xa wali rabafe ma, e man xa duba ɲama bɛ Alatala xili ra. Na nan nabafe han to lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Na fe na a toxi Lewi bɔnsɔɛ mu kɛ sɔtɔxi e ngaxakerenyie ya ma. Alatala nan na e tan malima ra alɔ a a fala ki naxɛ.<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />«N naxa lu geya fari yanyi tongo naani nun kɔɛ tongo naani alɔ n naxan naba singe ra. Alatala man naxa n ma maxandi suxu, barima a mu waxi wo faxafe. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, ‹Ɲama raɲɛrɛ. E xa so bɔxi ma n nan nakalixi naxan na e babae bɛ sofe ra e yi.›»<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />«Yakɔsi fa, Isirayilakae wo Marigi Alatala wama wo xa munse raba? A wama nɛ wo xa gaaxu a ya ra alako wo xa wo ɲɛrɛ a xa kira xɔn ma, wo xa a xanu, wo xa a rabatu wo bɔɲɛ fiixɛ nun wo nii birin na. <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />Alatala wama nɛ wo xa a xa yaamari raba, wo xa a xa sɛriyɛ rabatu, n naxan soxi wo yi ra to lɔxɔɛ, alako wo xa simaya xa fan. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Wo Marigi Alatala nan gbe na koore nun bɔxi ra, a nun se naxan birin na a ma. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Alatala wo babae nan xanu. Yakɔsi fa wo tan nan na e bɔnsɔɛ ra, a wo tan nan sugandixi boore sie tagi, alɔ wo a toxi ki naxɛ to lɔxɔɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />«Wo lan nɛ wo xa wo xaxili rasɛniyɛn, wo naxa xurutareɲa raba sɔnɔn, <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />barima wo Marigi Alatala keren peti nan na Ala ra, mangɛe xa mangɛ, Ala belebele sɛnbɛma magaaxuxi, naxan mu mixi rafisa a boore bɛ, naxan mu kiiti ɲaaxi kɔbiri rasuxuma. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />A tan nan kiridie nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe kantama ra. Xɔɲɛe rafan a ma, a donse nun sose soma e yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Wo tan fan, wo hinnɛ xɔɲɛe ra naxee na wo ya ma. Wo xa wo maɲɔxun xɔɲɛ nan nu na wo tan fan na Misira bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Wo xa gaaxu wo Marigi Alatala ya ra, wo xa tuubi a bɛ, wo xa bira a fɔxɔ ra, wo man xa wo rakali a tan nan xili ra. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />A tan nan na wo xa nɔrɛ ra. A tan nan na wo Marigi Ala ra, naxan kaabanakoe nun fe magaaxuxie rabaxi wo ya xɔri. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Wo babae nu fama tɛmui naxɛ Misira, e mu nu dangixi mixi tongo solofere ra. Yakɔsi wo Marigi Alatala bara wo rawuya dangi tunbuie ra naxee na koore ma.»<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Won ma xanunteya Ala bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />Wo xa wo Marigi Alatala xanu, wo tuubi a bɛ, wo xa a xa yaamari, a xa sɛriyɛ, a xa masenyi, nun a xa tɔnyi rabatu tɛmui birin.<verse eid="DEU 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Wo xa a kolon to lɔxɔɛ wo xa die mu Alatala xa kaabanako magaaxuxie toxi e ya ra. E mu wo Marigi Alatala xa sɛriyɛ mɛxi e tuli ra. <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />E mu a xa laamatunyie toxi Misira, a nun a naxan nabaxi Firawuna nun a xa bɔxi birin na. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />E man mu fe toxi a naxan nabaxi Misira sɔɔrie ra, e xa soe nun gisee ra. E mu a to Ala Misira sɔɔrie madulaxi Kale Baa ma ki naxɛ, e to bira wo fɔxɔ ra, Alatala fa e birin halaki kerenyi ra. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />E man mu fee toxi a naxee raba gbengberenyi ma beenun wo xa be li. <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />A naxa wo ratanga Datan nun Abirami ma, naxee findi Eliyabi xa di xɛmɛe ra Ruben bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. Isirayilakae birin ya xɔri, bɔxi naxa a rabi, a fa a raxutu e nun e xa denbayae birin ma, e xa kiri banxie, nun mixi birin ma naxee nu biraxi e fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Wo tan nan yati bara fe belebelee to Alatala naxee rabaxi.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />Na nan a toxi, wo lan wo xa yi sɛriyɛ rabatu n naxan xaranfe wo bɛ to lɔxɔɛ, alako wo xa limaniya sɔtɔ yi bɔxi masɔtɔfe ra wo na sigafe dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />Wo xa yi raba alako wo xa bu bɔxi ma Alatala a kalixi naxan xa fe ra, a sofe ra wo babae nun e bɔnsɔɛe yi, xiɲɛ nun kumi gbegbe na bɔxi naxan ma. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Wo fama bɔxi naxan sɔtɔde, a mu luxi alɔ Misira bɔxi, wo kelixi dɛnnaxɛ. Misira tan, wo na gɛ xɛ sade, fo wo nu ye maxanin a ma laakɔɛ daaxi wo sanyi ra. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Wo fama bɔxi naxan sɔtɔde, geya nun gulunba yire na a ra, tunɛ ye naxan nafanma a fanyi ra. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Bɔxi na a ra wo Marigi Alatala ɲɛngi saxi naxan xɔn. A man fa mɛɛni a ma, keli ɲɛ fɔlɛ han ɲɛ ɲɔnyi.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ala xa laayidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />Xa wo yi sɛriyɛ ratinmɛ a fanyi ra n naxan xaranxi wo bɛ yi ki to lɔxɔɛ, xa wo wo Marigi Alatala xanu, wo a xa sɛriyɛ raba bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra nun wo nii ra, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />a tunɛ rafama nɛ wo xa bɔxi ma, ɲɛmɛ a nun sogofure, alako wo xa harige fanyi sɔtɔ, alɔ mɛngi, wɛni nɛɛnɛ, a nun ture. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />A man ɲooge fan nafanma nɛ wo xa bɔxi ma wo xa xurusee naxan donma. Wo baloe gbegbe sɔtɔma nɛ, wo a don han wo luga. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Wo xa fe mɔɔli birin naba alako fefe yo naxa wo ba yi kira fanyi xɔn ma. Wo naxa wo igoro ala gbɛtɛe batufe ra. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Xa wo na fe mɔɔli raba, Alatala xɔnɔma nɛ wo ma. Na tɛmui a a niyama nɛ tunɛ mu fa sɔnɔn, sansi yo mu fanma bɔxi ma sɔnɔn, wo fa halaki yi bɔxi ma Alatala naxan soxi wo yi ra.<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Wo xa yi sɛriyɛ rasabati wo bɔɲɛ ma nun wo nii ra. Wo nde xiri wo bɛlɛxɛ nun wo tigi ra tɔnxuma ra, alako wo naxa nɛɛmu a ra. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Wo xa a xaran wo xa die ra wo xa banxie kui, wo xa biyaasie kui, wo sa tɛmui, wo keli tɛmui. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Wo xa a sɛbɛ wo xa banxie nun wo xa naadɛe ma. <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />Na nan a toma wo xa simaya nun wo xa die xa simaya xɔn kuyama bɔxi ma Alatala naxan laayidixi wo benbae bɛ han duniɲa raɲɔnyi. <verse eid="DEU 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />Xa wo yi sɛriyɛ rabatu a rabatu ki ma, n naxan xaranxi wo bɛ, xa wo wo Marigi Alatala xanu, xa wo wo ɲɛrɛ a xa kira xɔn ma, xa wo bira a fɔxɔ ra, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />Alatala fama nɛ yi sie birin keride wo ya xɔri, wo fa nɔ e ra, naxee gbangbalan wo bɛ, naxee sɛnbɛ gbo wo bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Wo na wo sanyi ti dɛnnaxɛ birin ma, naa findima wo gbe nan na. Wo xa bɔxi italama keli gbengberenyi ma han Liban, keli Efirati xure ma han Mediteran Baa ra. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Mixi yo mu suusama tide wo ya ra. Wo na siga bɔxi naxan yo ma, wo Marigi Alatala a niyama nɛ mɛnnikae xa gaaxu wo ya ra, e bɔɲɛ mini alɔ a masenxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />Wo a mato, n bara barakɛ nun dankɛ sa wo ya i to. <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Xa wo wo Marigi Alatala xa sɛriyɛ rabatu a rabatu ki ma, n naxan soxi wo yi ra to, wo barakɛ sɔtɔma nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />Kɔnɔ xa wo mu wo Marigi Alatala xa sɛriyɛ ratinmɛ, xa wo wo ba kira xɔn ma n naxan soxi wo yi ra to, xa wo bira ala gbɛtɛe fɔxɔ ra wo mu naxee kolon, wo dankɛ nan sɔtɔma.<verse eid="DEU 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Wo Marigi Alatala na wo xanin bɔxi ma a fama naxan sode wo yi ra, wo dubɛ masenyi tima Garisimi geya nan fari, wo dankɛ masenyi tima Ebali geya nan fari. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Na geyae na Yurudɛn naakiri nan ma, kira xanbi ra naxan na sogegorode, Kanaankae xa bɔxi ma naxee sabatixi Araba, Giligali ya tagi, More wuri belebele fɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Wo na Yurudɛn igiri sigafe ra bɔxi ma wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ sofe wo yi ra, mɛnni findima wo gbe nan na, wo man fa sabati naa. <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />Wo lan nɛ wo xa fɛntɛn yi sɛriyɛ nun yi yaamarie ma, n naxee soxi wo yi ra to lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Sali xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />Wo xa yi sɛriyɛ nun yaamarie rabatu bɔxi ma, wo babae Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ sofe wo yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Wo xa yire birin kana geyae fari nun fɔtɔnyie kui, yi sie kuyee batuma dɛnnaxɛ. Wo fama yi sie keride. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Wo xa e xa sɛrɛxɛbadee kana, wo xa e xa gɛmɛ tɔnxumae kana, wo xa e xa Aseri wuri masolixie gan, wo xa e xa kuyee rabira, wo xa e xilie ɲɔn naa.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Wo naxa wo Marigi Alatala batu na mɔɔli ra de. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Wo xa Alatala fen yire nde a dɛnnaxɛ sugandima wo bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. Na findima Ala xa yire nan na, a xili matɔxɔma dɛnnaxɛ. Wo xa siga mɛnni <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />wo xa sɛrɛxɛe mɔɔli birin bade, alɔ sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie, sɛrɛxɛ naxee mu ganma, farilɛe, hadiyae, sɛrɛxɛ naxee bama alako wo waxɔnfe xa raba, ɲanige sɛrɛxɛe, nun xuruse di singee. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Wo xa wo xa sɛrɛxɛe don mɛnni, wo tan nun wo xa denbayae. Wo xa ɲɛlɛxin harige ra, wo Marigi Alatala naxan fixi wo ma.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />A mu lanma kankan xa a yɛtɛ waxɔnfe raba, alɔ wo a rabafe ki naxɛ yakɔsi, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />wo to mu so bɔxi ma, wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fima wo ma malabude ra. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Kɔnɔ wo na Yurudɛn igiri, wo na sabati bɔxi ma wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fima wo ma, a fama nɛ wo ratangade wo yaxuie birin ma naxee na wo rabilinyi, wo fa sabati naa bɔɲɛsa kui. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Na tɛmui, mɛnni findima wo Marigi Alatala xa yire sugandixi nan na, a xili matɔxɔma dɛnnaxɛ. Wo xa wo xa sɛrɛxɛe ba mɛnni nɛ, n naxee yamarixi wo ra, alɔ sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie, sɛrɛxɛ naxee mu ganma, farilɛe, hadiyae, a nun sɛrɛxɛ naxee bama alako wo waxɔnfe xa raba. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Wo ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ wo Marigi Alatala ra, wo tan, wo xa die, wo xa konyie nun Lewi xa die naxee na wo ya ma barima bɔxi mu na e tan bɛ naxan findi e kɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Wo naxa wo xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie ba wo waxɔnde. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Wo e bama yire nɛ wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ sugandima wo bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. N naxan birin yamarixi wo ra, wo xa a birin naba mɛnni. <verse eid="DEU 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />Kɔnɔ i nɔma sube don daaxi faxade, Ala naxan fixi i ma, yire birin i na sabati dɛnnaxɛ. Mixi sɛniyɛnxi nun mixi sɛniyɛntare nɔma a donde, alɔ xeli nun tɔɔkɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Kɔnɔ wo mu lan wo xa sube wuli min, wo xa a ifili bɔxi ma alɔ ye.<verse eid="DEU 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Wo mu lan wo xa mɛngi, wɛni nɛɛnɛ, nun ture don wo xɔnyi, naxee findima wo xa farilɛ ra Alatala bɛ. Wo mu lan wo xa wo xa xuruse di singee fan don wo xɔnyi, wo naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ ra Alatala bɛ, sɛrɛxɛ naxee bama alako wo waxɔnfe xa raba wo bɛ, nun wo xa ɲanige sɛrɛxɛe. Wo mu lan wo xa wo xa bogi singee fan don wo xɔnyi, wo naxee bama sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Wo lan wo xa na see birin don wo Marigi Alatala nan ya i a xa yire sugandixi kui. Wo tan, wo xa die, wo xa konyie, a nun Lewi xa die naxee na wo ya ma, wo xa na sɛrɛxɛe don mɛnni ɲɛlɛxinyi kui wo Marigi Alatala ya i, a naxan fixi wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Wo wo ɲɛngi sa Lewi xa die xɔn ma a fanyi ra. Wo naxa nɛɛmu e ma.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />Wo Marigi Alatala na wo xa bɔxi ragbo yɛ, alɔ a a laayidixi wo bɛ ki naxɛ, xa wo wa sube nan xɔn ma, wo nɔma na donde han wo wasa. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Xa wo makuya Alatala xa yire sugandixi ra a xili matɔxɔma dɛnnaxɛ, wo nɔma xurusee faxade, wo Marigi naxee fixi wo ma, wo fa na sube don n ma sɛriyɛ ki ma wo xɔnyie han wo wasa. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Mixi sɛniyɛnxi nun mixi sɛniyɛntare nɔma e donde alɔ xeli nun tɔɔkɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Kɔnɔ wo mu lan wo xa sube wuli min, barima wuli findixi nii nan na. A mu lan wo xa sube nun a wuli don. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Wo naxa wuli min, wo xa a ifili bɔxi ma alɔ ye. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Wo naxa a min alako wo xa sɛɛwa, wo tan, nun wo xa die hali wo dangi xanbi. Wo xa fe tinxinxie raba, Alatala wama naxee xɔn.<verse eid="DEU 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Xa wo wama sɛrɛxɛ sɛniyɛnxi nan bafe Alatala bɛ, alako wo waxɔnfe xa raba wo bɛ, wo xa na sɛrɛxɛ ba yire nɛ Alatala dɛnnaxɛ sugandima. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Naxan findixi sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra, wo xa na sube nun na wuli sa wo Marigi Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛbade. Naxan findixi sɛrɛxɛ boore daaxi ra, wo xa a wuli ifili wo Marigi Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛbade, wo fa a sube tan don.<verse eid="DEU 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Wo wo tuli mati, wo lan nɛ wo xa yi sɛriyɛ ratinmɛ n naxan soxi wo yi ra, alako wo xa sɛɛwa, wo tan nun wo xa die hali wo faxa xanbi abadan, barima fe fanyi na a ra naxan nafan wo Marigi Alatala ma.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />Wo Marigi Alatala na gɛ sie halakide wo saabui ra, wo na sabati e xa bɔxi ma, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />wo xa wo yɛtɛ ratanga e xa fe kobi rabafe ma, e halaki xanbi. Wo xa wo yɛtɛ ratanga e xa alae maxɔrinfe ma. Wo naxa a fala, «Yi sie nu tuubi rabirama e bɛ di? N fan waxi na nan nabafe.» <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Wo naxa na mɔɔli raba wo Marigi Alatala ra, barima e nu fe kobie rabama e xa alae bɛ Alatala mu wama naxee xɔn. Mixi nan nu e ra, naxee nu e xa die ganma e xa kuyee bɛ sɛrɛxɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="s">Kuye batue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />Wo lan nɛ wo xa yi sɛriyɛ raba a raba ki ma n naxan soxi wo yi ra. Wo naxa sese ba a ra, wo man naxa sese fan sa a xun ma. <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />Xa namiɲɔnmɛ nde, xa na mu a ra waliyu nde, <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />sa kaabanakoe fe nun tɔnxuma fe raba wo ya xɔri, a man fa a fala wo bɛ, «Won bira kuye batufe fɔxɔ ra, wo tan mu alae naxee kolon,» <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />wo naxa wo tuli mati na namiɲɔnmɛ ra a nun na waliyu ra de. Wo Marigi Alatala nan fama wo matode na ki, alako a xa nɔ a kolonde xa a xa xanunteya na wo sondonmɛ ma, xa wo a xanuxi wo nii ra. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Wo lan wo xa tuubi rabira wo Marigi Alatala nan keren bɛ, wo xa gaaxu a ya ra, wo xa a xa yaamarie raba, wo xa a xui rabatu, wo xa a keren nan batu, wo xa bira a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="DEU 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />Yi namiɲɔnmɛ nun yi waliyu mɔɔli lan nɛ a xa faxa, barima a bara wa wo bɔɲɛ ratefe wo Marigi Alatala ma naxan wo raminixi konyiya kui Misira bɔxi ma. E bara wo ba kira xɔn Alatala wo tixi naxan na. Wo xa fe ɲaaxi ɲɔn wo tagi.<verse eid="DEU 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />Xa wo ngaxakerenyi, xa na mu a ra wo xa di, xa na mu a ra wo xa baatɛ ginɛ, xa na mu a ra wo boore naxan nafanxi wo ma alɔ wo yɛtɛ, sa wo manahanɛ alako wo xa ala gbɛtɛ batu, wo tan mu naxan kolon, wo babae fan mu naxan kolon, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />si gbɛtɛe naxee batuxi wo rabilinyi nun naxee makuya wo ra, keli bɔxi tuxui ma sa dɔxɔ boore tuxui ra, <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />wo naxa tin e xa wɔyɛnyi ra, wo naxa wo tuli mati e ra. Wo naxa kinikini e ma, wo naxa e nɔxun, wo man naxa e kanta. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Wo lan nɛ wo xa na kanyi faxa, wo a gɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra, ɲama fan fa a magɔnɔ. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Wo xa a magɔnɔ han a xa faxa, barima a bara kata a xa wo ragbilen wo Marigi Alatala fɔxɔ ra naxan wo raminixi konyiya kui Misira bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />Isirayilakae birin na na fe mɛ, e luma nɛ gaaxui kui. Na tɛmui na fe kobi mɔɔli mu nɔma rabade wo tagi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="DEU 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />Xa wo a mɛ taa nde xa fe ra, wo Marigi Alatala wo rasabatima dɛnnaxɛ, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />a mɛnnika ndee a falama e booree bɛ, «Won xa kuye nɛɛnɛ ndee batu,» <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />a lanma wo xa na mixi kobie xɔn nafen alako wo xa e kɛɲa kolon. Wo xa a kolon xa na fe kobi bara raba wo tagi. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Xa a sa na ki nɛ, wo xa na taakae birin faxa santidɛgɛma ra. Wo xa na taa halaki nun a xa xurusee birin na. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Wo e harige birin malanma taa tagi nɛ, wo tɛ sa a ma, wo taa birin gan wo Marigi Alatala ya i. Naa fama findide bɔxi rabɛɲinxi nan na. Mɛnni tan mu findima taa ra sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />Wo naxa na se ratɔnxi sese tongo wo yɛtɛ bɛ, wo na naxan ganfe alako nde xa ba Alatala xa xɔnɛ ra, a xa kinikini wo ma, a xa wo rawuya alɔ a rakalixi ki naxɛ wo babae bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 13:19" />Xa wo tuubi rabira wo Marigi Alatala bɛ a xa sɛriyɛ rabatufe ma, n naxan soxi wo yi ra to lɔxɔɛ, xa wo fe tinxinxi raba wo Marigi Alatala ya i, a fama nɛ na hɛɛri birin fide wo ma.<verse eid="DEU 13:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Ɲɔnfe sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />Marigi Alatala xa die lanxi wo tan nan ma. Xa faxɛ fa sa ti, Wo naxa wo yɛtɛ maxaba, wo naxa wo xunsɛxɛ bi wo tigi dɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Wo bara findi wo Marigi Alatala xa ɲama sɛniyɛnxi ra. A wo tan nan sugandixi bɔxi ɲama birin tagi, wo xa findi a gbe ra.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sube radaxamuxi nun a radaxamutare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />Wo mu lan wo xa se sɛniyɛntare don. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Subee nan yi ki, wo lan wo xa naxee don: ninge, yɛxɛɛ, si, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />xeli, gaale, tɔɔkɛ, muntui, burunyi si, geya fari sube naxan maniyaxi yɛxɛɛ ra, bole, <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />sube naxee tore itaxunxi, e man na ɲooge don, e gbilen a rate ra e kɔn na.<verse eid="DEU 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Kɔnɔ na subee ya ma, naxee tore itaxunxi firinyi ra, naxee ɲooge donma, e man fa gbilen a rate ra e kɔn na, ndee na e ya ma wo naxa e don alɔ ɲɔxɔmɛ, yere, nun yere maniyɛ. E findixi sube sɛniyɛntaree nan na wo bɛ, barima e ɲooge donma, e man fa gbilen a rate ra e kɔn na, kɔnɔ e tore mu itaxunxi firinyi ra. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Xɔsɛ naxan tore itaxunxi firinyi ra, kɔnɔ a mu ɲooge donma, a man xa gbilen a rate ra a kɔn na, na nan a findixi sube sɛniyɛntare ra wo bɛ. Wo naxa na sube don, wo man naxa wo bɛlɛxɛ din a binbi ra.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />Yɛxɛ naxee na ye xɔɔra, bɛlɛe na naxee birin bɛ a nun xalee, wo lan wo xa nee nan don. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Kɔnɔ wo mu lan wo xa yɛxɛ don bɛlɛ mu naxan bɛ a nun xale. Wo xa nee kolon yɛxɛ sɛniyɛntare ra.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />Wo nɔma xɔni sɛniyɛnxi birin donde. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Kɔnɔ xɔnie xilie nan yi ki wo mu lan wo xa naxee don: yubɛ, sɛgɛ, xaruma gbɔntɔɛ, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />a nun e maniyɛ birin. <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />Xaaxa fan wo naxa na don a nun a maniyɛ birin. <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />Xundi, koofole, a nun tagarantongoe, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />wo naxa e don a nun e maniyɛ birin. <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />Gbongboe, yedɔnmɛ, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />laaba, tukɛ, a nun e maniyɛ birin, wo naxa e don. <verse eid="DEU 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Nimase xunxuri gabutenyi kanyi birin raharamuɲaxi. Wo mu lan wo xa e don. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Wo lan wo xa nimasee nan don naxee sɛniyɛnxi.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Wo naxa sube don naxan faxaxi a yɛtɛ ma. Wo xa a so xɔɲɛ Ala kolontaree yi ra, naxee na wo xɔnyi, alako e xa a don, xa na mu wo xa a mati mixi gbɛtɛe ma. Wo tan bara findi wo Marigi Alatala xa ɲama sɛniyɛnxi ra.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Wo naxa si yɔrɛ ɲin a nga xiɲɛ ye ra.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farilɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />Wo sansi naxan birin nawalima xɛ ma, wo lan nɛ wo xa farilɛ ba a ra ɲɛ yo ɲɛ. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Wo xa na farilɛ don yire wo Marigi Alatala xili matɔxɔma dɛnnaxɛ. Wo xa farilɛ findima wo xa mɛngi, wo xa wɛni nɛɛnɛ, wo xa ture, wo xa xurusee xa di singee nan na. Wo xa na ba alako wo nɔma gaaxude wo Marigi Alatala ya ra ki naxɛ lɔxɔɛ birin. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Xa a sa li wo sabatide makuya wo Marigi Alatala xili matɔxɔde ra, na kote xaninfe xɔrɔxɔma nɛ wo bɛ, barima wo Marigi Alatala bara barakɛ gbegbe fi wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />Na tɛmui wo xa wo xa farilɛ masara kɔbiri ra, wo fa na xanin wo Marigi Alatala xili matɔxɔde. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Mɛnni wo nɔma xurusee, wɛni, nun wo waxɔnse gbɛtɛ sarade, alako wo nun wo xa denbayae xa wo dɛge wo Marigi Alatala ya i sɛɛwɛ kui. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Wo naxa nɛɛmu Lewikae ma naxee sabatixi wo ya ma, barima se mu na e bɛ naxan findima e kɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Ɲɛ saxan yo ɲɛ saxan wo xa wo xa sansi farilɛ birin nagata wo xɔnyi. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Na tɛmui Lewikae, kɛ mu na naxee bɛ, wo xa xɔɲɛe, kiridie, a nun kaaɲɛ ginɛ naxee na wo ya ma, e birin xa fa e dɛgede wo xɔnyi han e luga. Na kui wo Marigi Alatala fama barakɛ sade wo xa fe birin ma.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Diɲɛfe doni ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />Ɲɛ solofere yo ɲɛ solofere wo xa diɲɛ donie ma. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Na sɛriyɛ lan a xa raba yi ki nɛ: Fɛɛrɛ kanyie naxee birin doni bɛɲinxi e ngaxakerenyi bɛ, e lan nɛ e xa diɲɛ na doni ma. Wo mu lan wo xa wo boore nun wo ngaxakerenyi ɲaxankata doni fife ma ɲɛ kui Alatala naxan sugandixi. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Wo lan wo xa dɔxɔ Ala kolontare nan na a xa wo xa doni fi, kɔnɔ wo naxan donixi wo ngaxakerenyi bɛ, wo lan nɛ wo xa diɲɛ na ma. <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />Na nan a toma setare mu kolonma wo ya ma, barima Alatala barakɛ gbegbe sama nɛ wo xa fe bɔxi ma wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ soxi wo yi ra kɛ ra, alako a xa findi wo gbe ra. <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />A na rabama nɛ xa wo bira wo Marigi Alatala xui fɔxɔ ra. Wo xa a xa yaamari rabatu, n naxan falaxi wo bɛ to lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Wo Marigi Alatala barakɛ sama nɛ wo xa fe alɔ a masen ki naxɛ. Wo kɔbiri donima nɛ ɲama gbegbe bɛ, kɔnɔ wo tan mu doni tongoma. Wo fama nɛ dangide ɲama gbegbe ra, mixi yo mu dangima wo ra.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />Xa setare na wo ngaxakerenyie ya ma wo nun naxee sabatixi bɔxi keren ma wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fima wo ma, wo naxa wo nii raxutu, wo xa tondi doni bɛɲinde e bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Wo lanma nɛ wo xa a doni sɛɛwɛ kui a hayi na naxan ma. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Wo xa wo mɛɛni ki fanyi ra, xaxili ɲaaxi naxa nɔ wo ra a falafe ra, «A gbe mu luxi ɲɛ solofere nde xa a li, a lan mixi xa diɲɛ doni ma ɲɛ naxan na.» Wo xa wo mɛɛni, wo naxa kinikinitareɲa masen wo ngaxakerenyi setaree bɛ tondife se nde sode a yi ra. Na na raba, a a yaxaseri masama nɛ Alatala bɛ wo xa fe ra, wo fa findi yunubitɔɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Wo lan nɛ wo xa a ki bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra. Wo na bɔɲɛ fanyi naxan nabaxi na ki, wo Marigi Alatala barakɛ sama nɛ wo xa walie wo na so naxee yo ya ma. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Setaree luma nɛ wo xa bɔxi ma, na nan a toxi n na a falaxi wo bɛ wo xa hinnɛ wo ngaxakerenyie ra, misikiinɛ a nun setare naxee na wo xa bɔxi ma.<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Konyie xɔrɛyafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />Xa wo ngaxakerenyi Eburu xɛmɛ, xa na mu a ra ginɛ, a yɛtɛ mati wo ma konyi ra, a walima nɛ wo bɛ ɲɛ senni. A ɲɛ solofere nde wo xa a xɔrɛya. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Wo man naxa a bɛɲin a yi igeli ra. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Wo Marigi Alatala se naxan birin fixi wo ma barakɛ ra alɔ yɛxɛɛ, si, mɛngi, a nun wɛni, wo xa na ndee so a yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Wo wo ratu a ma konyi nan nu wo fan na Misira, wo Marigi Alatala fa wo xun sara. Na fe na a toxi, n yi sɛriyɛ soxi wo yi ra to lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Xa konyi nde fa a fala wo bɛ a mu kelima wo xa denbaya ya ma barima wo bara rafan a ma, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />na tɛmui wo se tunbase nan tongoma. Wo a tuli tunba banxi naadɛ ma. Na tɛmui a bara findi wo xa konyi ra kudɛ. Wo na mɔɔli nan nabama wo xa konyi ginɛ fan na. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Wo naxa nimisa xɔrɛya fife ra wo xa konyi ma, barima a xa wali ɲɛ senni bun ma na bara wo rageeni dɔxɔ firin dangi walikɛ sare ra. Na kui wo Marigi Alatala barakɛ sama nɛ wo xa wali birin ma na xa fe ra.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xuruse di singe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />Wo xa ninge, yɛxɛɛ, nun si di xɛmɛ singe naxee barima, e birin findima wo Marigi Alatala nan gbe ra. Wo mu lan wo xa ninge xɛmɛ di singe rawali, wo man mu lan wo xa yɛxɛɛ di xɛmɛ singe xabe maxaba a ma. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Ɲɛ yo ɲɛ wo tan nun wo xa denbaya nan na donma yire, wo Marigi Alatala xa yire sugandixi. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Xa a mabɛnxi, xa a ya kanaxi, xa na mu fure gbɛtɛ na a ma, wo naxa na fi wo Marigi Alatala ma sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Wo nɔma na donde wo xɔnyi nɛ, wo nun mixi sɛniyɛnxie, xa na mu a ra, mixi sɛniyɛntaree, alɔ wo xeli nun tɔɔkɛ donma ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Kɔnɔ wo naxa sube wuli don de. Wo a ifilima bɔxi nan ma alɔ ye.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />Abiba kike ra, wo xa Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali raba wo Marigi Alatala xa fe ra, barima na kike kui, wo Marigi Alatala wo ramini Misira ra kɔɛ nan na. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Wo sɛrɛxɛ naxee bama wo Marigi Alatala bɛ Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali lɔxɔɛ, e tongoma xuruse nan ya ma: yɛxɛɛ, si, xa na mu a ra ninge. Na sɛrɛxɛ bama Alatala xili matɔxɔde nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Wo naxa taami lɛbini daaxi don na sali xi solofere bun ma. Wo lan wo xa taami lɛbinitare nan don naxan findi kinikini taami ra. Na nan wo ratuma lɔxɔɛ ma wo gbataxi mini Misira bɔxi ra lɔxɔɛ naxɛ. Na a niyama nɛ wo mu nɛɛmu wo mini lɔxɔɛ ma Misira bɔxi ra. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Na xi solofere bun ma, a mu lan lɛbini siya xa to wo xɔnyi, wo xa bɔxi birin ma. Wo sɛrɛxɛ naxan bama a xi singe nunmare ra, na mu lan a xa lu han gɛɛsɛgɛ.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Na Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali sɛrɛxɛ mu lan a xa raba yire birin, wo Marigi Alatala wo rasabatixi dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />Wo a bama yire keren peti nɛ, wo Marigi Alatala xili matɔxɔde sɛniyɛnxi. Na sɛrɛxɛ bama nunmare nan na soge goro tɛmui, wo mini waxati naxan ma Misira bɔxi ra. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Wo sube ɲinma nɛ, wo a don yire wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ sugandixi. Kuye na iba, wo fa siga wo xɔnyi. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Xi senni bun ma, wo taami lɛbinitare nan donma. A xi solofere lɔxɔɛ wo malanyi belebele raba wo Marigi Alatala xa binyɛ bun ma. Wo naxa wali yo raba na lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xɛ Xabɛ Sali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />Wo na mɛngi xaba fɔlɔ, wo lɔxɔxun solofere nan kɔntima, <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />wo fa Lɔxunyie Sali raba wo Marigi Alatala bɛ. Wo Marigi Alatala barakɛ naxan fixi wo ma wo sɔtɔse ra, wo xa nde ba wo ɲanige ra na barakɛ bɛrɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Wo sɛɛwama nɛ wo Marigi Alatala ra yire a dɛnnaxɛ sugandixi a xili falafe ra, wo tan nun wo xa die, wo xa konyie, Lewikae naxee na wo xɔnyi, xɔɲɛe, kiridie, a nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Wo xa ratu konyi nan nu na wo ra Misira bɔxi ma. Wo lan nɛ wo xa yi sɛriyɛ raɲɛrɛ a raɲɛrɛ ki ma.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bage Ti Sali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />Wo na gɛ wo xa sansie bɔnbɔde lɔnyi ma, wo naxa wɛni bogi fan bundu, wo xa Bage Ti Sali raba xi solofere bun ma. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Wo xa sɛɛwa na sali kui, wo tan, wo xa die, wo xa konyie, Lewikae, xɔɲɛe, kiridie, a nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe naxee na wo xɔnyi. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Wo yi sali rabama xi solofere nan bun ma wo Marigi Alatala bɛ a na dɛnnaxɛ sugandi, barima wo Marigi Alatala barakɛ sama nɛ wo xa xɛ wali nun wo xa wali birin ma, wo fa sɛɛwa ki fanyi ra.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />Ɲɛ yo ɲɛ, xɛmɛ naxan birin na wo ya ma, e lan nɛ e xa ti e Marigi Alatala ya i sanya saxan, yire a dɛnnaxɛ sugandixi: Taami Lɛbinitare Sali, Lɔxunyie Sali, a nun Bage Ti Sali. Wo mu lan wo xa siga Alatala ma wo yi igeli ra. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Wo keren keren ma fama sɛrɛxɛ nan na wo nɔxi naxan na, wo Marigi Alatala naxan fixi wo ma barakɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛriyɛ raɲɛrɛ ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />Taae birin kui, wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fixi wo ma, bɔnsɔɛ yo bɔnsɔɛ, wo kiitisae nan sugandima, e xa ɲama makiiti tinxinyi kui. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Wo naxa tɔɔɲɛgɛ kiiti sa de, wo man naxa ti mixi yo xɔn ma. Wo naxa tin fe nde xa wo madaxu, barima se nɔma nɔndi falɛe findide nɛ dɔnxui ra, e nɔndi mafindi wule ra. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Wo lanma wo xa kiiti tinxinxi yati nan sa, alako wo xa simaya sɔtɔ, wo man xa nɔ bɔxi masɔtɔde wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fixi wo ma.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuye rabatufe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />Wo mu lan wo xa Aseri wuri masolixi ti sɛrɛxɛbade fɛ ma, wo dɛnnaxɛ yailanxi wo Marigi Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Wo naxa gɛmɛ ti kuye ra, barima wo Marigi Alatala na fe mɔɔli xɔnxi.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="s">Sɛrɛxɛ fanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />Wo mu lan wo xa ninge xa na mu yɛxɛɛ ba sɛrɛxɛ ra wo Marigi Alatala bɛ, naxan kɛɲa mu fan, xa na mu a ra naxan mabɛnxi, barima wo Marigi Alatala na fe mɔɔli xɔnxi.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />Xa wo mixi nde to wo xa taae kui, wo Marigi Alatala naxee fixi wo ma, naxan ala gbɛtɛ batuma, a bara fe ɲaaxi raba naxan mu rafan wo Marigi Alatala ma. A bara Ala xa saatɛ matandi <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />tuubi rabirafe ala gbɛtɛe bɛ, xa na mu soge, kike, nun tunbuie bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />Wo na na fe mɔɔli ifalɛ mɛ, wo xa a xɔn nafen a fanyi ra. Wo na a kolon na fe xɔnxi bara raba Isirayila bɔxi ma, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />a na findi xɛmɛ ra, xa na mu ginɛ, wo a kanyi xaninma taa sode dɛ nan na, wo a magɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra han a xa faxa.<verse eid="DEU 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Mixi naxan lan a xa faxa, a mu faxama sinden fo a tongo seede firin xui ma, xa na mu a ra saxan. A mu lan a xa faxa seede keren gbansan xui ma. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Seedee nan singe gɛmɛ wolima a ma a faxafe ra, ɲama dɔnxɔɛ fan fa a magɔnɔ. Wo fe ɲaaxi ɲɔnma wo tagi na ki nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiiti magaaxuxie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />Xa faxa kiiti bara fa, xa na mu a ra galanbui, xa na mu maxɔnɛ, naxan findixi kiiti xɔrɔxɔɛ ra wo bɛ taa kui, wo xa siga yire wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ sugandixi. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Wo sigama Lewika sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nan xɔn, a nun kiitisae naxee na wo xun ma, wo a tagi raba e bɛ. E a falama wo bɛ na tɛmui a lan kiiti xa sa ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />E naxan falama wo bɛ yire, wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ sugandixi, wo kiiti bolonma na ki nɛ. E naxan falama wo bɛ, wo xa na birin naba. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />E sɛriyɛ naxan birin falama wo bɛ, wo xa na raba. Wo naxa binya yirefanyi ma, xa na mu kɔɔla ma. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Xa mixi nde, a xa yɛtɛ igboɲa kui, mu a tuli mati kiitisae nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra, wo Marigi Alatala naxee sugandixi a xa wali rabafe ma, na kanyi lanma nɛ a xa faxa. Wo fe ɲaaxi ɲɔnma wo tagi na ki nɛ Isirayila. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Ɲama birin fama lude gaaxui nan kui na tɛmui. E na yi fe mɛ naxan nabaxi, mixi gbɛtɛ yo mu suusama na yɛtɛ igboɲa mɔɔli rabade fa.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mangɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />Wo na so bɔxi ma tɛmui naxɛ, wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fima wo ma, wo na sabati naa, tɛmunde wo fama nɛ a maɲɔxunde wo fan xa wo gbe mangɛ sɔtɔ alɔ boore si naxee wo rabilinxi. <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />Wo Marigi Alatala na mixi naxan sugandi, na nan fama findide wo xa mangɛ ra. Wo naxa tin xɔɲɛ xa findi wo xa mangɛ ra, wo ngaxakerenyi mu naxan na. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />A mu lan soe gbegbe xa lu wo xa mangɛ yi ra. A mu lan a xa mixie rasanba Misira e sarade, barima Alatala a falaxi nɛ wo bɛ, a wo naxa siga na bɔxi ma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />A mu lan a xa ginɛ gbegbe dɔxɔ. Na fee nan fama a ragbilende Alatala fɔxɔ ra. A mu lan a xa gbeti gbegbe nun xɛɛma gbegbe malan.<verse eid="DEU 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Mangɛ na dɔxɔ a xa mangɛ kibanyi tɛmui naxɛ, sɛriyɛ kitaabui naxan nagataxi Lewika sɛrɛxɛdubɛe yi ra, a xa na misaali yailan a yɛtɛ bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />A xa na kitaabui ragata a fɛ ma, a xa a xaran lɔxɔɛ birin a xa simaya kui, alako a xa gaaxu a Marigi Alatala ya ra, a man xa nɔ a xa sɛriyɛ nun a xa yaamari rabatude naxan sɛbɛxi a kui. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Na fe nan fama a niyade, a mu a yɛtɛ rafisa a ngaxakerenyie bɛ, a man mu tantan sɛriyɛ ma, a mu binya yirefanyi ma nun kɔɔla ma. Na tɛmui a mangɛya xɔnkuye sɔtɔma nɛ, a tan nun a xa die Isirayila ɲama tagi.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xa wali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />Lewika sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun Lewi xabilɛ dɔnxɔɛe mu fama bɔxi sɔtɔde kɛ ra alɔ Isirayila di booree. E baloe findima sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie nan na naxee bama Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />E mu fama kɛ sɔtɔde e ngaxakerenyie tagi. Alatala nan findima e kɛ ra alɔ a a masen e bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Lewika sɛrɛxɛdubɛe mabiri findima sɛrɛxɛe nan na Isirayilakae fama naxee bade alɔ ningee, xa na mu a ra yɛxɛɛe. A lanma sube bɛlɛxɛ, a banganyi, nun a furi nan xa so sɛrɛxɛdubɛe yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Wo man fa bɔxi daxamui singe so e yi ra: mɛngi, wɛni nɛɛnɛ, ture, a nun wo yɛxɛɛ xabe naxan singe maxabama. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Wo Marigi Alatala Lewi bɔnsɔɛ nan sugandixi bɔnsɔɛ birin tagi, alako e tan nun e xa die xa nɔ Alatala xili binyade tɛmui birin.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />Xa Lewika nde wa kelife Isirayila taa kui a na dɛnnaxɛ, sigafe ra yire Alatala dɛnnaxɛ sugandixi, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />mɛnni, a lanma a xa a Marigi Alatala xa wali raba a nun a ngaxakerenyi Lewikae ra naxee na naa. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />A lan nɛ a xa baloe sɔtɔ alɔ sɛrɛxɛdubɛ booree, bafe a harige ra a faxi naxan na a xun ma, a bara naxan sɔtɔ.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sematoe nun duuree</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />Wo na so tɛmui naxɛ bɔxi ma, wo Marigi Alatala naxan fima wo ma, wo mu lan wo xa so wali ɲaaxie ya ma mɛnnikae na naxee kui. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Mixi naxa mini wo ya ma de naxan a xa di ganma sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxan findima sematoe ra, ya kanyi ra, duure ra, kɔrɔmixi ra, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />naxan karamɔxɔ wali rabama, naxan wɔyɛnma barie, ɲinnɛe, nun mixi faxaxie ra. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Wo Marigi Alatala na mixi mɔɔli xɔnxi. Na fe kobie na a toxi, wo Marigi Alatala yi sie halakima wo ya ra. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Wo xa lu wo Marigi Alatala waxɔnki. <verse eid="DEU 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Wo fama si naxee halakide na ki, e biraxi sematoe xui nan fɔxɔ ra, kɔnɔ wo Marigi Alatala mu tinma wo tan xa na raba.<verse eid="DEU 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Namiɲɔnmɛ wali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />Wo Marigi Alatala fama namiɲɔnmɛ nde rakelide wo ya ma, naxan luma alɔ n tan. Wo xa wo tuli mati a ra. <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />Wo na nan yati maxɔrin wo Marigi Alatala ma, wo nu malanxi lɔxɔɛ naxɛ Xorebe geya fari. Wo naxa a fala, «Muxu mu wama muxu Marigi Alatala xui mɛfe fa. Muxu mu wama yi tɛ belebele fan tofe kɔrɛ, alako muxu naxa faxa.» <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, «E fe fanyi nan falaxi n bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />N fama nɛ namiɲɔnmɛ nde rakelide e ya ma, naxan luxi alɔ i tan. N fama n ma masenyi fide a ma, a fa na tagi raba e bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Mixi nde na lu, a mu a tuli mati na namiɲɔnmɛ xa masenyi ra a naxan tima n xili ra, n tan yɛtɛ yati nan na kanyi makiitima.»<verse eid="DEU 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />«Kɔnɔ xa namiɲɔnmɛ yɛtɛ igboe nde fa masenyi ti n xili ra, n mu naxan fixi a ma, xa na mu a masenyi ti ala gbɛtɛ xili ra, a lanma nɛ na kanyi xa faxa. <verse eid="DEU 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Tɛmunde wo fama nɛ wo yɛtɛ maxɔrinde, ‹Won nɔma a kolonde di xa yi wɔyɛnyi fatanxi Alatala nan na?› <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Xa namiɲɔnmɛ masenyi ti Alatala xili ra, a fa lu a mu kamali, na nan na ki a xa masenyi mu fatanxi Alatala ra. Namiɲɔnmɛ nan na falaxi a xa yɛtɛ igboɲa kui. Hali wo mu gaaxu a ya ra.»<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Mixi ratanga taae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />Wo Marigi Alatala na fa sie halakide wo ya ra, a fa e xa bɔxi so wo yi ra, wo fa sabati e xa taae nun e xa banxie kui, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />wo xa taa saxan sugandi na bɔxi tagi, wo Marigi Alatala naxan fixi wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Wo xa bɔxi maniya, wo Marigi Alatala naxan fixi wo ma kɛ ra, wo fa a itaxun dɔxɔ saxan. Na nan a toma faxati nde nɔma sigade na taa nde kui, alako a nii xa ratanga.<verse eid="DEU 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Mixi naxan faxɛ tixi, a mu a rakelixi a ma, na faxati mɔɔli nan gbansan nɔma sode yi taa nde kui a nii ratangafe ra. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Misaali nan ya: Xa mixi siga fɔtɔnyi wuri sɛgɛde, a nun a boore, a xa beera fa koren, a din a boore ra, na fa faxa, na faxati mɔɔli tan nɔma sode yi taa nde kui a nii ratangafe ra. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />A xa na raba alako mixi naxan wama na fure gbeɲɔxɔfe a xa bɔɲɛte kui, a naxa nɔ faxɛti lide kira ra, a fa a faxa. Na mu lanma, barima xɔnnanteya yo mu nu na a bɛ na mixi faxaxi xa fe ra. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />N yi yaamari fixi wo ma na nan ma. Wo xa taa saxan sugandi, nee xa findi mixi ratanga taae ra.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />Xa wo Marigi Alatala wo xa bɔxi ragbo yɛ alɔ a rakali ki naxɛ wo babae bɛ, xa a yi bɔxi birin so wo yi ra a naxan laayidixi wo babae bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />xa wo yi yaamari raba a raba ki ma n naxan falaxi wo bɛ to lɔxɔɛ, wo Marigi Alatala naxa rafan wo ma, wo naxa bira a xa kira fɔxɔ ra, na tɛmui wo man xa taa saxan sugandi, wo xa e sa yi taa saxanyi boore xun ma. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Na kui, mixi tɔɔɲɛgɛxi mu faxama wo xa bɔxi ma, wo Marigi Alatala naxan fixi wo ma kɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />Kɔnɔ xa mixi nde a yaxui xɔn, a a mɛlɛn, a a faxa, a fa so yi taa nde kui, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />na taa forie lan nɛ e xa a suxu, e a xanin mixi xɔn ma naxan wama na fure gbeɲɔxɔfe, alako faxɛti xa faxa. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Wo naxa kinikini yo ti na kanyi ma. Wo na faxati mɔɔli ɲɔnma na ki nɛ Isirayila bɔxi ma, alako bɔɲɛsa xa lu wo yi ra.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔxi naaninyi nun seede wule falɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />Wo na sabati bɔxi ma wo Marigi Alatala naxan fixi wo ma kɛ ra, wo naxa naaninyi tɔnxumae masiga de wo benbae naxee dɔxɔ. <verse eid="DEU 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />Mixi naxan yunubi fe rabaxi, xa na mu a ra haakɛ, na kanyi mu lan a xa makiiti mixi keren xa seede baxi ma. Na mɔɔli makiitima seede firin, xa na mu, seede saxan xui nan ma.<verse eid="DEU 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Xa seede ɲaaxi ba nde sa mixi nde tɔɔɲɛgɛ fe nde ma, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />yi gere mixi firinyie lan nɛ e xa siga Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, e sa e xa galanbui yaxaran sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun kiitisae bɛ naxee na na waxati. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Kiitisae a fe xɔn nafenma nɛ a ki nun a kɛɲa ma. E na a kolon seede wule nan saxi a ngaxakerenyi xun ma, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />a ngaxakerenyi nu wama a makiitife ki naxɛ, wo xa na kiiti ragbilen a ma. Wo fe ɲaaxi ɲɔnma wo tagi na ki nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Mixi gbɛtɛe na na fe mɛ, gaaxui nan luma e ma, e mu suusama na fe kobi mɔɔli rabade fa. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Wo naxa kinikini na mixi mɔɔli ma. Xa a mixi nan faxaxi, wo a fan faxa. Xa a mixi ya nan kanaxi, wo a fan ya kana. Xa a mixi ɲinyi nan giraxi, wo a fan ɲinyi gira. Xa a mixi bɛlɛxɛ nan bolonxi, wo a fan bɛlɛxɛ bolon. Xa a mixi sanyi nan bolonxi, wo a fan sanyi bolon.<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Gere sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />Wo na siga wo yaxuie gerede, wo fa a to e xa soee, geresosee, nun sɔɔrie dangi wo gbe ra, hali wo mu gaaxu. Wo Marigi Alatala naxan wo raminixi Misira bɔxi ra, a na wo fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Wo nɛ wo yailanma tɛmui naxɛ gere sofe ma, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nan tima a wɔyɛn ɲama bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />«Isirayila, wo wo tuli mati! To lɔxɔɛ wo faxi wo yaxuie nan gerede. Limaniya naxa ba wo yi ra de, wo naxa gaaxu, wo bɔɲɛ naxa mini a i, wo naxa sɛrɛn, <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />barima wo Marigi Alatala na wo fɔxɔ ra wo yaxuie gerede. A e rayarabima nɛ wo bɛ, wo fa xutu sɔtɔ e ma.»<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />Na tɛmui mangɛ xa kuntigie xa sɔɔrie maxɔrin, «Mixi nde na wo ya ma, naxan bara gɛ banxi tide kɔnɔ a mu soxi a kui sinden? Na kanyi xa gbilen a xɔnyi, barima xa a faxa gere kui, mixi gbɛtɛ fama nɛ sode a xa banxi kui. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Mixi nde na wo ya ma be, naxan wɛni bili sixi, a mu a bogi baxi sinden? Na kanyi xa gbilen a xɔnyi, barima xa a faxa gere kui, mixi gbɛtɛ fama nɛ a xa wɛni bogi bade. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Mixi nde na wo ya ma be, naxan bara wa ginɛ xɔn, kɔnɔ a mu a futixi sinden? Na kanyi xa gbilen a xɔnyi, barima xa a faxa gere kui, mixi gbɛtɛ fama nɛ a xa ginɛ futide.» <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Mangɛ xa kuntigie man xa sɔɔrie maxɔrin, «Mixi nde na wo ya ma be limaniya baxi naxan yi, a gaaxu? Na kanyi fan xa gbilen a xɔnyi alako a naxa limaniya ba a booree fan yi.» <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Mangɛ xa kuntigie na gɛ wɔyɛnde ɲama ra, e xa mangɛe ti yi sɔɔri xundɛe ya ra.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Wo na wo makɔrɛ wo yaxuie xa taae ra gereso ki ma, wo xa lanyi maxɔrin e ma. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Xa e tin na ra, e taa naadɛ rabi wo bɛ, e birin xa lu wo xa yaamari nan bun ma, e nu duuti fi. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Kɔnɔ xa e mu tin lanyi ra, e fa wo yaabi gere ra, na tɛmui wo xa na taa bilin. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Wo Marigi Alatala e rayarabima nɛ wo bɛ. Wo xa xɛmɛ birin faxa santidɛgɛma ra, <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />wo xa ginɛe, dimɛe, xurusee, nun se naxan birin na taa kui, wo xa a tongo wo yɛtɛ bɛ sɛɛwɛ kui. Wo Marigi Alatala bara na fi wo ma.<verse eid="DEU 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Wo xa na mɔɔli raba taae fan na, naxee makuya wo ra, naxee mu na taae ya ma wo fama sabatide dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Kɔnɔ wo naxa sese lu a ɲiɲɛ ra taae kui, wo Marigi Alatala fama naxee fide wo ma kɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Wo Xitikae, Amorikae, Kanaankae, Peresikae, Hiwikae, nun Yebusukae birin halakima nɛ alɔ wo Marigi Alatala a masenxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ, <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />alako e naxa wo xaran na fe xɔnxie rabafe ra e naxee rabama e xa alae bɛ, na fa findi yunubi fe ra wo bɛ wo Marigi Alatala mabiri.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Wo na taa nde bilin a gerefe ma, a mu lan wo xa beera tongo sansie sɛgɛ xili ma. E findima wo balose nan na. Na daaxa sansie xa mu findixi wo gerefae ra. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Sansi naxee bogi mu nɔma donde, wo nɔma nee tan sɛgɛde e xa findi geresose ra wo bɛ taa mixie xili ma, wo nun naxee na gerefe han e sa rayarabima wo bɛ tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Faxati kolontare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />Xa a sa li wo naxa mixi nde fure to bɔxi ma burunyi, wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fixi wo ma, kɔnɔ wo mu a faxama kolon sinden, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />wo xa forie nun wo xa kiitisae xa a mato taa mundun makɔrɛxi na fure ra. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />E na taa kolon naxan makɔrɛxi na ra, na taa forie xa ninge ginɛ tongo, naxan singe mu nu wali, wuri mu nu xiri naxan kɔn ma, <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />e xa a xanin xure nde ma, naxan mu xɔrima, sansi mu rawalima dɛnnaxɛ, e xa a kobe gira ye xɔɔra. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Na birin xa raba Lewi xa di sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ya xɔri, barima wo Marigi Alatala nee nan sugandixi a xa wali rabafe ma, e xa duba mixi bɛ Alatala xili ra, e xa kiiti sa gere xa fe ra.<verse eid="DEU 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Fori naxee birin na taa kui naxan makɔrɛxi fure yire ra, e xa e bɛlɛxɛe raxa ninge ginɛ fari, e naxan faxaxi xure kui. <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />E xa a fala, «Muxu tan xa mu faxɛ tixi, muxu mu a rabama fan kolon. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Alatala, i xa Isirayila ɲama xun sara, i naxan xɔrɛyaxi. Yandi, i naxa faxɛ kote dɔxɔ Isirayila xun ma, e fɔxi mu na naxan na.» Na tɛmui Alatala fama nɛ e xun sarade. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Wo nɔma ratangade yi faxɛ tife mɔɔli ma, xa wo Alatala waxɔnfe rabama.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gere xa geelimanie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Wo na siga wo yaxuie gerede, xa wo Marigi Alatala e rayarabi wo bɛ, wo e findi wo xa geelimanie ra, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />tɛmunde mixi nde ya fama nɛ sinde geelimani ginɛ tofanyi nde ma. Xa na kanyi wama a dɔxɔfe nɛ, <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />a nɔma a xaninde a xɔnyi. Na ginɛ xa a yɛtɛ xunyi bi, a a bɛlɛxɛ xale maxaba, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />a dugi fanyi ragoro a ma. A xa sabati a xa mɔri xɔnyi, a fa a baba nun a nga xa ɲɔnfe raba kike keren bun ma. Na dangi xanbi xɛmɛ nɔma a findide a xa ginɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Xa a sa li a xa fe naxa raɲaaxu a ma, a nɔma a bɛɲinde a xa siga a waxɔnde, kɔnɔ a mu lanma a xa a mati kɔbiri ra, a mu lanma a xa findi a xa konyi ra, barima a nu bara findi a xa ginɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Di fori tide</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />Xa a sa li ginɛ firin na xɛmɛ nde yi ra, keren fa rafan a ma dangi boore ra, kɔnɔ e firinyie bara di bari a bɛ, a mu lanma a xa baatɛ ginɛ xa di rafisa a boore xa di bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />a fa foriɲa tide fi baatɛ ginɛ xa di ma, a fa a li na ginɛ boore nan singe di barixi a bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />A lanma a xa a kolon ginɛ naxan naɲaaxuxi a ma na ki, na nan ma di findixi di singe ra. A harige dɔxɔ firin nan soma di fori yi ra, barima na nan findixi a xa fonike di ra. A tan nan lanma a xa di foriɲa tide sɔtɔ.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Di xurutare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />Xa a sa li xɛmɛ nde naxa di xɛmɛ kalabante xurutare bari, naxan mu a tuli matixi a baba nun a nga xui ra, naxan tondima birade e xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />a lanma na di baba nun a nga xa a suxu, e xa a xanin forie xɔn ma taa sode dɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />E xa a fala e bɛ, «Muxu xa di naxan yi ki, a xurutare, a kalabante. Muxu fe naxan birin falama a bɛ, a mu a tuli matima a ra, fo wayuɲa rabafe nun siisi fe.» <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Na kui, a xa taa xɛmɛ birin xa a magɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra, han a faxa. Wo fe ɲaaxi ɲɔnma wo tagi na ki nɛ. Isirayilakae na na fe mɛ, gaaxui luma nɛ e birin ma.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mixi gbakuxi fure</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />Xa a sa li wo bara mixi gbaku wuri kɔn na, naxan bara yunubi fe raba a lan a xa faxa naxan ma, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />a fure mu lan a xa lu wuri kɔn na han gɛɛsɛgɛ. A lan nɛ a xa ragata na lɔxɔɛ kerenyi, barima Ala bara fure gbakuxi danka. Wo wo mɛɛni ki fanyi ra, xa na mu a ra na fure gbakuxi nan bɔxi dankama, wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fixi wo ma kɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="s">Xuruse nun se lɔɛxie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />Wo na wo ngaxakerenyi xa ninge, xa na mu a ra a xa yɛxɛɛ to, a murutaxi, wo naxa wo kobe ti a ra. Wo lan nɛ wo xa a xanin a kanyi xɔn ma. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Xa wo ngaxakerenyi yire makuya, xa na mu wo mu a kanyi kolon, wo xa xuruse xanin wo xɔnyi. Wo a ragata han beenun wo a kanyi toma tɛmui naxɛ, wo fa a so a yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Wo na mɔɔli nan nabama wo ngaxakerenyi xa sofale fan na, a xa donma, a nun a gbe se naxan birin lɔɛxi a ma. Wo mu lan wo xa wo kobe ti a ra. <verse eid="DEU 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />Xa wo bara wo ngaxakerenyi xa sofale, xa na mu a ra a xa ninge to, a bara bira kira xɔn ma, wo mu lan wo xa wo kobe ti a ra. Wo lan nɛ wo xa kafu a ma a rakelide.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xɛmɛ naxee e yɛtɛ findima ginɛ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />Ginɛ mu lan a xa xɛmɛ dugi so. Xɛmɛ fan mu lan a xa ginɛ dugi so. Mixi naxee na fe mɔɔli rabama, na kanyie mu rafan Marigi Alatala ma.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kinikinife daalisee ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />Wo na a to kira xɔn ma, xɔni bara a tɛɛ sa wuri kɔn na, xa na mu a ra bɔxi ma, a nga felenxi a xɛlɛ ma, xa na mu a ra a xa die ma, wo mu lan wo xa a nga nun a xa die birin tongo. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Wo lan nɛ wo xa a nga tan nabɛɲin, a xa siga, wo fa die tan tongo. Na kui wo fama nɛ simaya xɔnkuye nun hɛɛri sɔtɔde.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mixi ratanga ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />Xa wo banxi nɛɛnɛ ti, wo lan nɛ wo xa bilixi nde rabilin banxi fuge ra, alako mixi naxee tema naa, e naxa bira, e fa faxa wo saabui ra.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Se masunbufe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />Wo mu lan wo xa sansi gbɛtɛ si wo xa wɛni bilie ya ma, xa na mu a ra a bogi fama findide se raharamuxi nan na. <verse eid="DEU 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />Wo nɛ yire buxama, wo mu lan wo xa ninge nun sofale xiri e boore ra sari ra. <verse eid="DEU 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />Wo mu lan wo xa sose ragoro wo ma naxan masunbuxi dugi yɛxɛɛ xabe daaxi nun gɛsɛ fute daaxi ra.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafelenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />Wo gɛsɛ nan nafalama ponpon na wo a singan wo xa dugi tuxui naanie ra, wo naxan felenma wo ma.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ginɛ fe kiiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />Xa a sa li xɛmɛ nde naxa ginɛ dɔxɔ, e kafu, kɔnɔ a xa fe to raɲaaxu xɛmɛ ma, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />a a xili kana wɔyɛn kobi ra, a nu fa a fala, «N bara yi ginɛ dɔxɔ, kɔnɔ muxu to kafu n naxa a li a bara futi kana,» <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />Na tɛmui ginɛ baba nun a nga xa ginɛdimɛdi dugi xanin taa forie xɔn ma taa sode dɛ ra, naxan a masenxi a e xa di futi rasoxi. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />A baba xa a tagi raba, «N bara n ma di ginɛ fi yi xɛmɛ ma, kɔnɔ a mu rafan a ma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />A fa wule nan safe a xun ma a a mu futi rasoxi.» Na tɛmui tɛmɛdi xa mixie xa na ginɛdimɛdi dugi itala taa forie ya i.<verse eid="DEU 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Taa forie na na to, e xa na xɛmɛ suxu, e xa a ɲaxankata. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />E na a makiiti, e xa alamani bolon a ma naxan findima kɔbiri kole kɛmɛ sofe ra tɛmɛdi baba yi ra, Isirayila ginɛ xili kanafe ma. Na xanbi a lan nɛ ginɛ xa gbilen xɛmɛ xɔnyi, na xɛmɛ naxa mɛɛ a ra abadan.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Kɔnɔ xa futi kanafe fa sa findi nɔndi ra, ginɛdimɛdi dugi yo mu na naxan a masenma a bara futi raso, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />na ginɛ xa xanin a baba xa banxi sode dɛ ra, taa mixie fa a magɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra han a faxa, barima a bara fe kobi raba ginɛ mu lan a xa naxan naba Isirayila bɔxi ma, xɛmɛ fe kolonfe ra a na a baba xa nɔɛ bun ma tɛmui naxɛ. Wo fe ɲaaxi ɲɔnma wo tagi na ki nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />Xa wo xɛmɛ suxu, e nun ginɛ xɛmɛ taa idɔxɔɛ saxi, na fe kobi raba firinyie lan nɛ e xa faxa, ginɛ nun xɛmɛ. Wo fe ɲaaxi ɲɔnma na ki nɛ wo tagi Isirayila bɔxi ma.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Xa xɛmɛ naralan ginɛ dimɛdi nde ra taa kui, kote bara dɔxɔ naxan ma fe ra, a fa a futi kana, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />wo xa na mixi firinyie xanin taa sode dɛ ra, wo e magɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra han e xa faxa. Yi ginɛ dimɛdi faxaxi nɛ, barima a mu sɔnxɔɛ ratexi taa kui. Xɛmɛ fan faxaxi nɛ, barima a bara ginɛ futi kana kote bara dɔxɔ naxan ma fe ra. Wo fe ɲaaxi ɲɔnma wo tagi na ki nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Kɔnɔ xa xɛmɛ naralan ginɛ dimɛdi ra wula i, kote bara dɔxɔ naxan ma fe ra, a naxa dutun a ma, a a futi kana, na xɛmɛ nan keren lan a xa faxa. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Wo naxa fefe raba ginɛ dimɛdi tan na, barima a mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi a lan a xa faxa naxan ma. Yi fe maniyaxi nɛ alɔ xɛmɛ naxan waxi a boore faxafe. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Na naralanyi rabaxi wula nɛ. Hali yi ginɛ dimɛdi xɛmɛ kanyi sɔnxɔɛ rate nu, mixi yo mu sɔtɔma naxan nɔma a ratangade.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />Xa xɛmɛ naralan ginɛ dimɛdi ra kote mu nu dɔxɔ naxan ma fe ra, a naxa bagan a ma, a a futi kana, mixi nde fa e suxu na fe xun, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />na xɛmɛ kɔbiri kole tongo suuli nan soma ginɛ baba yi ra, a fa yi ginɛ dɔxɔ, barima a bara a futi kana. A xa simaya kui, a mu lan a xa mɛɛ na ginɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Langoeɲa mɔɔli nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />Mixi yo mu lan a nun a baba xa ginɛ xa kafu. A tana fe nan na ra a baba mabiri.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mixi naxee mu lan e xa lan Alatala xa malanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Mixi naxan xɛmɛya kanaxi, xa na mu a ra a bolonxi, na kanyi mu lan a xa siga Alatala xa malanyi. <verse eid="DEU 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Yangamadi fan mu sigama Alatala xa malanyi hali a bɔnsɔɛ fu nde.<verse eid="DEU 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Amonikae nun Mowabakae mu sigama Alatala xa malanyi hali e bɔnsɔɛ fu nde. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />A luma e bɛ na ki nɛ kudɛi barima yi ɲamae mu fa wo ralande taami nun ye ra, wo nu na kira xɔn ma tɛmui naxɛ wo kelixi Misira. E Beyori xa di xɛmɛ Balami nan sare fi wo dankafe ma Petori, Mesopotamiya bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Kɔnɔ wo Marigi Alatala mu tin a tuli matide Balami ra. A naxa na dankɛ masara barakɛ ra barima wo rafan wo Marigi Alatala ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />Wo naxa wo ɲɛngi sa e xa bɔɲɛsa nun e xa baloe fe xɔn ma wo xa simaya kui.<verse eid="DEU 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Wo naxa fe ɲaaxi yo raba Edonkae ra, barima wo ngaxakerenyi nan na e ra. Wo naxa fe ɲaaxi yo niya Misirakae ra, barima wo saxanyi raba nɛ e xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />E fama bɔnsɔɛ naxee sɔtɔde, fo e tolobitɛe, nee nan fama sigade Alatala xa malanyi.<verse eid="DEU 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔɔri tɛtɛ kui xa sɛniyɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Wo na mini fafe ra tide wo yaxuie ya ra, wo lan nɛ wo xa wo yɛtɛ ratanga fe kobi birin ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Xa xɛmɛ nde na wo ya ma naxan mu sɛniyɛnxi, a bara makana wantanyi kui, a lan nɛ a xa mini sɔɔri tɛtɛ fari ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />Nunmare ra, a na a maxa ye ra, soge goro tɛmui a fa so sɔɔri tɛtɛ kui.<verse eid="DEU 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Wo fama yire nde nan sugandide dɛnnaxɛ makuya sɔɔri tɛtɛ ra, naa xa findi suturade ra. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Yili ge se nde lan nɛ a xa lu wo xa kote i. Wo na siga suturade, wo yili ge. Wo na gɛ wo hayi rabade, wo a makoto, wo fa keli naa. <verse eid="DEU 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />Wo xa sɔɔri tɛtɛ lan nɛ a xa sɛniyɛn, barima wo Marigi Alatala a maɲɛrɛma a kui wo kantafe ra, a man fa wo yaxuie rayarabi wo bɛ. Xa a fe ɲaaxi li sɔɔri tɛtɛ kui, a a makuyama nɛ wo ra.<verse eid="DEU 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛriyɛ konyi xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Xa konyi nde a gi a kanyi ma, a naxa siga lude wo xɔnyi, wo naxa gbilen a ra a kanyi xɔn ma de. <verse eid="DEU 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />A lan nɛ a xa sabati wo xa taa nde kui dɛnnaxɛ na rafan a ma. Wo man naxa a tɔɔrɔ de.<verse eid="DEU 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Langoeɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Isirayila xɛmɛ, xa na mu a ginɛ mu lan a xa langoeɲa raba. <verse eid="DEU 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />Langoe sare mu lan a xa so wo Marigi Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui laayidi rakamalise ra, barima wo Marigi Alatala na fe mɔɔli xɔnxi.<verse eid="DEU 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Doni nun daakan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Wo na se nde doni wo ngaxakerenyi bɛ, kɔbiri, donse, xa na mu a ra se gbɛtɛ, wo naxa geeni yo fen a fari. <verse eid="DEU 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Ala kolontare nan lanma a xa wo xa geeni sa, kɔnɔ wo ngaxakerenyi tan mu a ra de. Wo na na sɛriyɛ rabatu bɔxi ma wo fama dɛnnaxɛ sɔtɔde, wo Marigi Alatala barakɛ sama nɛ wo isofe birin ma.<verse eid="DEU 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Wo na daakan tongo wo Marigi Alatala bɛ, wo naxa taxiri a rabafe ma, xa na mu wo Marigi Alatala a maxɔrinma nɛ wo ma, wo fa findide yunubitɔɛe ra. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Xa wo mu daakan tongoxi, yunubi fe mu na. <verse eid="DEU 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />Kɔnɔ xa wo daakan tongo wo Marigi Alatala bɛ, wo lan nɛ wo xa a raba keren na a fanyi ra. Wo fa a raba alɔ wo a ɲanigexi wo dɛ ra ki naxɛ.<verse eid="DEU 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Wo nɔma wuri bogi ndee bade wo gbe mu naxee ra, wo a don han wo luga, kɔnɔ a mu lan wo xa nde sa wo xa kote i. <verse eid="DEU 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 23:26" />Wo na so mɛngi xɛ fan na, wo gbe mu naxan na, wo nɔma tɔnsɔɛ ndee bade wo bɛlɛxɛ ra, kɔnɔ wo mu lan wo xa wɔrɔtɛ tongo wo ngaxakerenyi xa mɛngi xili ma.<verse eid="DEU 23:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Xɛmɛ nun ginɛ fatanfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />A nɔma a lide xɛmɛ nde xa ginɛ mu rafanxi a ma sɔnɔn, a fatan kɛɛdi sɛbɛ, a a so a yi ra, a fa a rasiga a baba xɔnyi. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Na tɛmui xa na ginɛ dɔxɔ xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ xɔn ma, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />a xa fe raɲaaxu na xɛmɛ fan ma, na fan fa fatan kɛɛdi sɛbɛ, a a so a yi ra, a fa a rasiga a baba xɔnyi, xa na xɛmɛ fa sa faxa nɛ, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />xɛmɛ naxan singe mɛɛ na ginɛ ra, na mu lan a xa a findi a xa ginɛ ra kɔrɛ, barima a bara raharamuɲa a ma. Alatala na fe mɔɔli xɔnxi. Wo mu lan wo xa na yunubi mɔɔli raba bɔxi ma wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ fixi wo ma kɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛriyɛ naxan ibunadama ratangama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />Xɛmɛ naxan baxi ginɛ dɔxɔde, a mu lan a xa sɔɔriɲa raba waxati nde bun ma. Kɔntɔfili gbɛtɛ yo mu lan a xa dɔxɔ a ra ɲɛ keren bun ma, alako a xa mɛɛni a xa ginɛ dɔxɔxi ma.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Wo mu lan wo xa mulunyi nun kile rasuxu mixi yi sɛɛkɛ ra, xa na mu a ra kile gbansan, barima wo a balose nan bama a yi ra na ki.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />Xa Isirayilaka a ngaxakerenyi nde suxu nɔɛ ra, a a findi konyi ra, xa na mu a a mati, a lan nɛ na kanyi xa faxa. Wo fe ɲaaxi ɲɔnma wo tagi na ki nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />Wo lan nɛ wo xa fɛntɛn kunɛ fure xa fe ra. N xaranyi naxan soxi Lewi xa di sɛrɛxɛdubɛe yi, wo lan nɛ wo xa na raba a raba ki ma. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Wo xa ratu a ma a wo Marigi Alatala naxan naba Mariyama ra wo kelixi Misira tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />Wo na doni ti wo ngaxakerenyi bɛ, a mu lanma wo tan xa so a xɔnyi a xa sɛɛkɛ se tongode. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Wo xa lu tande, wo xa donifa xa fa sɛɛkɛ se ra wo xɔn ma, a a so wo yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Xa setare na a ra, a fa a xa xinbeli donma so wo yi sɛɛkɛ se ra, wo mu lan wo xa na ragata wo xɔnyi kɔɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Wo xa a ragbilen a ma soge goro waxati nɛ, alako a xa a felen a ma kɔɛ ra. Na kui a Ala maxandima nɛ wo bɛ. Setare malife na ki a findima tinxinyi nan na wo nun wo Marigi Alatala tagi.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />Wo mu lan wo xa wo xa walikɛ setaree tɔɔrɔ, e findi wo ngaxakerenyie ra, xa na mu e findi xɔɲɛe ra. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Lɔxɔɛ birin wo lan nɛ wo xa e xa wali sare fi e ma beenun soge xa goro, barima setare nan e ra, e hayi na na ma. Xa wo mu na rabama, a mawama nɛ Alatala bɛ wo xa fe ra, wo fa yunubi sɔtɔ na kui.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />Di babae mu lan e xa faxa e xa die xa yunubie rabafe ma. Die fan mu lan e xa faxa e babae xa yunubie rabafe ma. Ibunadama lanma a xa faxa a yɛtɛ xa yunubi rabaxi nan ma.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />Wo naxa tinxintareya raba mixie ra naxee faxi sabatide wo xa bɔxi ma. Wo naxa kiridie tɔɔrɔ. Wo naxa kaaɲɛ ginɛ xa donma tongo sɛɛkɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Wo xa ratu a ma a wo Marigi Alatala wo xɔrɛyaxi ki naxɛ wo xa konyiya kui Misira bɔxi ma. Na fe na a toxi n yi yaamari fixi wo ma.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />Wo na gɛ xɛ xabade, wo naxa gbilen tɔnsɔɛ dɔnxɔɛe tongo ra. Wo xa e lu xɔɲɛe, kiridie, nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe bɛ, alako wo Marigi Alatala xa barakɛ sa wo xa fe. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Wo na gɛ oliwi bili ifuyanfuyande, wo naxa gbilen bogi dɔnxɔɛe bade sansie kɔn na. Wo xa e lu xɔɲɛe, kiridie, nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Wo na gɛ wɛni bogi bade, wo naxa gbilen bogi dɔnxɔɛe ba ra. Wo xa e lu xɔɲɛe, kiridie, nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Wo xa ratu wo xa konyiya ma Misira bɔxi ma. Na fe na a toxi n yi yaamari fixi wo ma.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="s">Sɛriyɛ Luxusinyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Xa a sa li mixi firin naxa gere, kiitisa xa e mato tinxinyi kui sɛriyɛ ki ma. <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Nɔndi mu na naxan bɛ, xa a lanma a xa bɔnbɔ, na xa raba kiitisa ya xɔri fe rabaxi bɛrɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Na kui, wo mu lan wo xa dangi luxusinyi ya tongo naani ra. Xa wo nde sa na fari, wo bara wo ngaxakerenyi rayarabi.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninge xa wali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />Wo na ninge rawali mɛngi turuxunde tɛmui naxɛ, wo mu lan wo xa a dɛ xiri.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaaɲɛ ginɛ ditare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />Xa ngaxakerenma firin sabati yire keren, keren fa faxa a ditare ra, a xa kaaɲɛ ginɛ mu lan a xa dɔxɔ xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ xɔn ma xabilɛ gbɛtɛ kui. A lan a xa dɔxɔ a nimɔxɔ nan xɔn ma, a findi a xa ginɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Na ginɛ di singe naxan barima a nimɔxɔ bɛ, a xa findi a xa mɔri singe xa di nan na kɛ ki ma, alako a xa mɔri xili naxa lɔɛ Isirayila bɔxi ma.<verse eid="DEU 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Xa na xɛmɛ tondi a nimɔxɔ dɔxɔde, kaaɲɛ ginɛ xa siga taa forie nan xɔn ma kiitisae yire, a a tagi raba e bɛ yi ki, «N nimɔxɔ bara tondi bɔnsɔɛ fide a ngaxakerenyi ma, a mu tinma a xa sɛriyɛ rakamalide n tan mabiri.» <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Taa forie xa na xɛmɛ xili, e xa na fe mato. Xa na xɛmɛ tondi a ngaxakerenyi xa kaaɲɛ ginɛ dɔxɔde, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />kaaɲɛ ginɛ xa a makɔrɛ a ra taa forie ya xɔri, a xa a nimɔxɔ xa sankiri ba, a dɛye bɔxun a yatagi, a falafe ra, «Yi mɔɔli nan lan a xa raba xɛmɛ ra naxan tondima bɔnsɔɛ fide a ngaxakerenyi ma.» <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Na tɛmui Isirayila, na xɛmɛ xa denbaya xili falama nɛ, «Sankiri ba xa denbaya.»<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dinyi naxan mu lan a xa raba gere kui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />Xa a sa li xɛmɛ firin na gerefe, keren xa ginɛ fa siga a xa mɔri bade boore yi ra a xɛmɛya suxufe ra, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />wo xa na ginɛ bɛlɛxɛ bolon, wo naxa kinikini a ma.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinxinyi yulɛya kui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />Wo naxa kiloe kamalitare sa wo xa gbɔnfɔɛ kui, ndee binya, booree yelebu. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Wo naxa se maniyase kamalitare fan lu wo xɔnyi, ndee xungbo, booree xurun. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Kiloe kamalixi nun se maniyase kamalixi nan lan a xa lu wo yi ra. Na tɛmui wo fama nɛ simaya xɔnkuye sɔtɔde bɔxi ma wo Marigi Alatala fama dɛnnaxɛ sode wo yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Mixi yo na mɔɔli rabama, a mu rafanma wo Marigi Alatala ma.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wo yaxui Amalɛkikae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />Wo xa ratu a ma Amalɛkikae naxan naba wo ra wo to keli Misira. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />E mu gaaxu Ala ya ra. E mini nɛ wo ma kira xɔn, e xanbirati taganxie bɔnbɔ. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Yakɔsi, wo Marigi Alatala fama nɛ wo ratangade wo yaxuie ma, naxee na wo rabilinyi bɔxi ma a fama dɛnnaxɛ sode wo yi ra. Wo fama Amalɛkikae rahalakide, alako e xili xa lɔɛ duniɲa ma. Wo naxa nɛɛmu e xa fe rabaxi ma.<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Bɔxi daxamui singe nun farilɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Wo na so bɔxi ma wo Marigi Alatala naxan fima wo ma kɛ ra, a xa findi wo gbe ra, wo xa sabati naa, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />wo keren keren ma fama na daxamui singe sɛɛti bade wo Marigi Alatala bɛ. Wo a sa debe kui, wo xa a xanin yire, wo Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ sugandixi a xili matɔxɔfe ra. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Wo xa siga sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xɔn, naxee na naa na waxati, wo xa a fala e bɛ, «To lɔxɔɛ won bara so bɔxi, won Marigi Alatala dɛnnaxɛ laayidi won benbae bɛ a sofe ra won yi ra.»<verse eid="DEU 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ na debe rasuxuma nɛ wo yi ra, a a dɔxɔ wo Marigi Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛbade ya i. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Wo xa yi wɔyɛnyi fala wo Marigi Alatala bɛ, «N baba, Aramika nan nu a ra naxan nu a ɲɛrɛma. A naxa goro Misira mixi ndee ra, a saxanyi raba naa. E naxa wuya, han e findi si belebele sɛnbɛma ra, <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />kɔnɔ Misirakae tan naxa muxu ɲaxankata, e muxu tɔɔrɔ, e konyiya xɔrɔxɔɛ dɔxɔ muxu ma. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Muxu naxa muxu benbae Marigi Alatala makula, a xa muxu mali. A naxa muxu xa maxandi suxu, a man naxa muxu xa mantɔɔrɔli to, e nu fe ɲaaxi nun fe xɔrɔxɔɛe naxee dɔxɔma muxu ma.»<verse eid="DEU 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />«Alatala naxa muxu ramini Misira bɔxi ma sɛnbɛ magaaxuxi, kaabanakoe, nun tɔnxumae ra. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />A naxa fa muxu ra han be, a fa yi bɔxi so muxu yi ra, xiɲɛ nun kumi xɛlɛma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Na nan a toxi, yakɔsi n faxi yi bɔxi daxamui singe ra i tan Alatala xɔn ma, i naxan fixi n ma.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">Wo xa na dɔxɔ wo Marigi Alatala ya i, wo a batu. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Wo xa sɛɛwa wo boore ra, wo tan nun Lewikae, a nun xɔɲɛ naxee na wo ya ma, barakɛ ra, wo Marigi Alatala naxan fixi wo nun wo xa denbaya ma.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />Ɲɛ saxan yo ɲɛ saxan na a li, wo xa na ɲɛ farilɛ fi Lewikae, xɔɲɛe, kiridie, nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe ma, naxee na wo xa taae kui. Nee fan baloe findima na nan na. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Na tɛmui, wo xa a masen wo Marigi Alatala bɛ, «Naxan findixi i gbe ra, n bara a birin namini n xɔnyi. N bara a so Lewikae, xɔɲɛe, kiridie, nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe yi alɔ i a yamarixi ki naxɛ muxu bɛ. N mu i xa yaamari matandixi, n mu nɛɛmuxi keren ma. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />N mu farilɛ siya donxi ɲɔnyi to so n ma, xa na mu a ra, n to lu sɛniyɛntareɲa kui. N mu a fixi sɛrɛxɛ ra mixi faxaxi bɛ. N bara bira i tan, n Marigi Alatala, xui nan fɔxɔ ra. I naxan yamarixi n bɛ, n bara na birin naba. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />I xa muxu mato, kelife i xa koore sɛniyɛnxi ma. I xa barakɛ sa i xa ɲama Isirayila ma, i xa barakɛ sa bɔxi ma, i naxan fixi muxu ma, i naxan laayidixi muxu benbae bɛ, xiɲɛ nun kumi gbegbe na dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />To lɔxɔɛ wo Marigi Alatala bara wo yamari wo xa a xa masenyi nun a xa sɛriyɛ rabatu a rabatu ki ma. Wo xa wo ɲɛngi sa na sɛriyɛ xɔn ma wo bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />To lɔxɔɛ wo bara laayidi tongo Alatala bɛ, a a tan nan na wo Marigi Alatala ra, a wo xa ɲɛrɛ a xa kira xɔn ma, a wo xa a xa masenyi, a xa sɛriyɛ, nun a xa yaamari rabatu. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Wo saatɛ tongoxi nɛ a bɛ, a wo tan nan na a xa ɲama ra, alɔ a a falaxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ. Wo xa bira a xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra, <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />alako a xa fisamanteya fi wo ma si birin xun ma a naxee daaxi. Wo xa nɔrɛ, wo xili, nun wo sɛnbɛ xa dangi e birin na. Wo xa findi ɲama ra naxan a xa wali rabama, alɔ a masenxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Barakɛ nun dankɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Annabi Munsa nun ɲama forie yi masenyi nan ti Isirayilakae bɛ, «Wo xa mɛɛni yi yaamarie ma, n naxee fixi wo ma to lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Wo na Yurudɛn xure igiri tɛmui naxɛ, sigafe ra bɔxi ma wo Marigi Alatala naxan fima wo ma, wo xa gɛmɛ xungbe ndee ti, wo e mafiixɛ. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Wo na Yurudɛn igiri sigafe ra bɔxi ma, wo Marigi Alatala naxan fima wo ma, xiɲɛ nun kumi gbegbe na dɛnnaxɛ, alɔ wo babae Marigi Alatala a falaxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ, <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />wo xa yi gɛmɛe nan ti Ebali geya fari, n baxi naxee xa fe falade wo bɛ ya, wo fa e mafiixɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />«Mɛnni wo xa sɛrɛxɛbade yailan gɛmɛe ra wo Marigi Alatala bɛ, wure mu dinxi naxee ra, <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />naxee mu masolixi fefe ma. Wo xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ndee ba wo Marigi Alatala bɛ na sɛrɛxɛbade fari. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Wo xa xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe fan ba, wo naxee donma sɛɛwɛ kui wo Marigi Alatala ya i. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Wo xa Ala xa sɛriyɛ sɛbɛ na gɛmɛ tixie ma, alako ɲama xa nɔ xarande a fanyi ra.»<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Annabi Munsa nun Lewika sɛrɛxɛdubɛe naxa yi masenyi ti ɲama bɛ, «Isirayila ɲama, wo wo sabari. Wo xa wo tuli mati. To lɔxɔɛ, wo bara findi wo Marigi Alatala xa ɲama ra. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Wo xa bira wo Marigi Alatala xui fɔxɔ ra. Wo xa a xa masenyi nun a xa sɛriyɛ rabatu a rabatu ki ma, n naxan xaranfe wo bɛ to lɔxɔɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Na lɔxɔɛ kerenyi, Annabi Munsa man naxa yi yaamari so ɲama yi ra, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />«Wo na Yurudɛn igiri, Simeyɔn bɔnsɔɛ, Lewi bɔnsɔɛ, Yuda bɔnsɔɛ, Isakari bɔnsɔɛ, Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ, nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xa ti Garisimi geya fari, e xa dubɛe ti. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Ruben bɔnsɔɛ, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ, Aseri bɔnsɔɛ, Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ, Dana bɔnsɔɛ, nun Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xa ti Ebali geya fari, e xa dankɛe ti. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa na masenyi madangi Isirayila ɲama bɛ e xui itexi ra.»<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan kuye masolima, xa na mu a ra a kuye yailanma yɔxui raxunuxi ra, a tuubi a bɛ dunxui ra. Alatala na se mɔɔli xɔnxi.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan a baba nun a nga rayaagima.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan naaninyi tɔnxuma masigama.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan dɔnxui ratantanma kira ma.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan sɛriyɛ rakanama xɔɲɛ, kiridi, xa na mu a ra kaaɲɛ ginɛ ra.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan sama a baba xa ginɛ fɛ ma, a a baba rayaagi.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan yɛnɛ rabama xuruse ra, na findi xuruse yo ra.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan nun a maaginɛ kafuma, a baba xa di ginɛ, xa na mu a nga xa di ginɛ.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan nun a bitanyi ginɛma kafuma.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan a boore faxama nɔxunyi kui.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan kɔbiri rasuxuma mixi tɔɔɲɛgɛxi faxafe ra.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />«Dankɛ na mixi bɛ naxan tondima Ala xa sɛriyɛ rabatude.» Ɲama birin fa a ratin, «Amina.»<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Barakɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />«Xa wo bira wo Marigi Alatala xui fɔxɔ ra bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra, xa wo yi yaamarie rabatu n naxee soxi wo yi ra to lɔxɔɛ, Alatala wo findima nɛ si fisamante ra si birin tagi duniɲa kui. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Wo yi barakɛ nan sɔtɔma xa wo bira wo Marigi Alatala xui fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />A barakɛ sama nɛ taakae nun daaxakae ma, <verse eid="DEU 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />e xa die, daxamui, yɛxɛɛe, sie, nun ningee xun masama nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />A wo xa sagae rafe bogi se ra, a barakɛ sa wo xa farin namaxadee.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Wo xa simaya kui, a barakɛ sama nɛ wo xa fe birin. <verse eid="DEU 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />Wo yaxuie na fa wo gerede, Alatala e rayarabima nɛ wo bɛ. Xa e so kira keren nan na, e gbilenma e gi ra nɛ wo ya ra kira solofere xɔn. <verse eid="DEU 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />Wo Marigi Alatala barakɛ sama nɛ wo xa sansi rawalide nun wo na so fe naxan birin ya ma. A barakɛ sa wo xa fe bɔxi ma, a dɛnnaxɛ fima wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />Xa wo wo Marigi Alatala xa masenyi raba a raba ki ma, wo man naxa bira a waxɔnfe fɔxɔ ra, a wo findima a yɛtɛ xa ɲama nan na alɔ a a rakalixi wo bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Bɔxi ɲamae birin a kolonma nɛ na tɛmui, a wo tan nan sugandixi Alatala xa wali rabafe ma, e gaaxuma nɛ wo ya ra.<verse eid="DEU 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Alatala wo harige xun masama nɛ bɔxi ma a dɛnnaxɛ saatɛ tongo wo benbae bɛ sofe ra wo yi. A wo xa die rawuyama nɛ, a wo xa xurusee rawuya. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Alatala ye ragatade rabima nɛ wo bɛ koore ma, tunɛ xa fa wo xa bɔxie ma a waxati ma, alako wo xa walie xa fan. Wo hayi mu birama kɔbiri doni fe ma, fo wo tan kɔbiri doni xɔɲɛe bɛ de. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Alatala wo tan nan findima si birin ma yarerati ra. Wo mu luma xanbi, wo fisamanteya nan sɔtɔma tɛmui birin. Wo mu nimisama fefe ma, kɔnɔ fo wo xa yi yaamari rabatu nɛ a rabatu ki ma, n naxan xaranxi wo ra to lɔxɔɛ wo Marigi Alatala xa fe ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Fefe yo naxa a niya wo xa ba yi kira xɔn ma n naxan falaxi wo bɛ. Wo naxa bira ala gbɛtɛe batufe fɔxɔ ra fefe ma.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dankɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />Xa wo fa tondi wo Marigi Alatala batude, xa wo tondi a xa yaamarie nun a xa sɛriyɛ rabade, n naxee xaranxi wo ra to lɔxɔɛ a xa fe ra, na tɛmui a fama yi dankɛ nan birade wo fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />A taakae nun daaxakae dankama nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />A mu bogi se sama wo xa sagae kui, a man mu barakɛ sama wo xa farin namaxadee. <verse eid="DEU 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />A tondima nɛ di fide wo ma, wo man mu baloe sɔtɔma. Wo xa ningee, yɛxɛɛe, nun sie xun mu masama. <verse eid="DEU 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Wo dankɛ nan sɔtɔma yire birin wo xa simaya kui.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />Wo na so fefe yo naxan ya ma, a dankɛ ragoroma nɛ wo ma. A wo kui ifuma nɛ alako wo xa fe naxa sɔɔnɛya fefe ma, wo xun xa ra kana, barima wo bara fe ɲaaxi raba, wo man bara gbilen Alatala fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="DEU 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Alatala fure ɲaaxi radinma nɛ wo ma, han wo ɲɔn bɔxi ma a dɛnnaxɛ soma wo yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Alatala a niyama nɛ wo xa xɔsi, wo fate xa gan, wo xa fura a ɲaaxi ra. A man bɔxi xara, sansie gan soge bun ma, e fan fure ɲaaxi sɔtɔ. A na birin nabama nɛ wo ra, han wo lɔɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Koore nun bɔxi xarama nɛ a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Alatala tunɛ mafindima nɛ xube ra, naxan goroma wo xa bɔxi ma, a wo sɔntɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />Alatala sɛnbɛ fima nɛ wo yaxuie ma e wo rayarabi. Xa wo e gere kira keren nan na, wo wo gima nɛ e ya ra kira solofere xɔn. Naxan nabama wo ra, a duniɲa birin magaaxuma nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Wo binbie findima xɔnie nun wulai subee xa donse nan na. Mixi yo mu fama e keride.<verse eid="DEU 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Alatala suuri ikonkonma nɛ wo ma alɔ a naxan naba Misirakae ra. A wo tɔɔrɔma nɛ mangɛ faxɛ ra, kasi, nun xɛɲɛnyi naxan mu yalanma. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Alatala wo findima nɛ dɔnxuie ra, a daxui fure fan fi wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Yanyi ra wo nɛ wo ɲɛrɛma, wo luma kira mɛlɛn na nɛ alɔ dɔnxuie. Wo xa wali yo mu findima a ra, wo luma tɔɔrɔ ra nɛ. Mixie fama nɛ wo harige bade wo yi ra, e wo tɔɔrɔ a ɲaaxi ra. Marakisima yo mu luma wo bɛ.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Wo na kote dɔxɔ ginɛ xa fe ra, xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ a futi kanama nɛ. Wo na banxi ti, wo mu nɔma sode a kui. Wo na wɛni bilie si, wo mu nɔma e bogi bade. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Wo xa ningee kɔn naxabama nɛ wo ya xɔri, wo mu nɔ e sube donde. E wo xa sofale muɲama nɛ wo ma, wo mu a masɔtɔma. Yaxuie wo xa xuruse yɔrɛe tongoma nɛ, mixi yo mu fama wo malide. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Si gbɛtɛ mixie wo xa die suxuma nɛ wo ya xɔri, e e findi konyie ra. Wo taganma nɛ wo xa die mamɛde, wo mu nɔma na yaxuie ra fefe ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Si nde wo mu naxan kolon e baloma wo xa sansie nan xun na, wo xa bɔxi daxamui findima e tan nan gbe ra. E wo rawalima nɛ, e man fe ɲaaxi raba wo ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Na fe tofe wo findima nɛ daxuie ra.<verse eid="DEU 28:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Alatala fi ɲaaxi dɔxɔma nɛ wo ma, naxan mu yalanma. A goroma xinbie nun bɛlɛnyie nan ma, a fa yensen fate yire birin na, keli wo xunyi ma, a dɔxɔ wo sanyie ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />Alatala fama nɛ wo tan nun wo xa mangɛe rasigade bɔxi nde ma, wo tan nun wo benbae mu naxan kolon. Mɛnni wo fama nɛ ala gbɛtɛe batude, naxee masolixi wuri nun gɛmɛ ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Mɛnnikae wo mayelema nɛ, e yoma wo ma.<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Wo sansi xɔri gbegbe rawalima nɛ wo xa xɛe ma, kɔnɔ wo dondoronti nan xabama, barima katoe dinma nɛ a birin na. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Wo wɛni sansi sima nɛ, wo mɛɛni a ma a fanyi ra, kɔnɔ wo mu a ye minma, barima kuli soma e i nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Oliwi bilie luma nɛ bɔxi yire birin ma, kɔnɔ wo mu e ture masoma wo ma, barima oliwi bogie birama nɛ, e mu gbeeli.<verse eid="DEU 28:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Wo die barima nɛ, kɔnɔ e mu luma wo yi, barima wo yaxuie e xaninma nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Wo xa wurie nun bɔxi daxamui findima katoe nan gbe ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Xɔɲɛ naxee na wo ya ma, nee sɛnbɛ xun masama nɛ tɛmui birin, kɔnɔ wo tan xa fe magoroma nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Fɛɛrɛ luma nɛ e yi ra, kɔnɔ wo tan luma setareɲa nan kui. E findima nɛ wo xa yareratie ra, kɔnɔ wo tan luma e xanbi ra nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Yi dankɛ birin dɔxɔma nɛ wo fari, han wo birin gɛ halakide, barima wo bara tondi wo Marigi Alatala xui ratinmɛde. Wo mu a xa yaamari nun a xa sɛriyɛ rabatuxi a rabatu ki ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Na findima tɔnxuma nun dɛixarɛ nan na wo tan nun wo bɔnsɔɛ bɛ abadan.<verse eid="DEU 28:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Wo to mu tin wo Marigi Alatala batude sɛɛwɛ nun bɔɲɛsa kui, fe fanyi birin xa lu wo yi ra, <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />wo fama nɛ tɔɔrɔde wo yaxuie yi ra. Kaamɛ nun ye xɔli wo suxuma nɛ. Wo tima nɛ wo mageli ra, wo luma setareɲa nan kui. Na kui Alatala fama yɔlɔnxɔnyi sade wo kɔnyi ma, han wo gɛ halakide. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />A fama nɛ si ra wo mu naxan xa xui mɛma kelife yire makuye, a xa goro wo ma alɔ sɛgɛ goroma tɔxɔɛ yɔrɛ ma ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Mixi kaarinxie nan e ra, naxee mu forie binyama, naxee mu kinikinima dimɛe ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />E wo xa xuruse nun wo xa baloe tongo e yɛtɛ bɛ, wo xa faxa kaamɛ ra. E wo xa mɛngi, wɛni, ture, ninge yɔrɛe, yɛxɛɛe, nun sie birin xaninma nɛ. Wo fama nɛ halakide.<verse eid="DEU 28:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />E fama nɛ wo xa taae birin nabilinde, wo Marigi Alatala naxee so wo yi ra. E wo gerema nɛ han wo xa tɛtɛ itexi sɛnbɛmae yolon, wo laxi naxee ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Na geree kui wo yaxuie wo rakaamɛma nɛ, han wo wo xa die sube yati don, die wo Marigi Alatala naxee fixi wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Hali xɛmɛ fanyi naxan luma wo ya ma, a mu kinikinima a ngaxakerenma, a xa ginɛ, nun a xa die ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />A tondima nɛ a xa di sube itaxunde e ra, barima na findixi a baloe dɔnxɔɛ nan na. Wo yaxuie na marayarabi sama nɛ wo fari wo xa taae birin kui. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Hali ginɛ fanyi naxan luma wo ya ma, naxan mu tinma a sanyi yati xa manɔxɔ, na tan fan mu kinikinima a xa mɔri fanyi nun a xa die ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />A tondima nɛ a xa diyɔrɛ sube itaxunde e nun na xanbiratoe ma a naxan barixi, barima a tan wama na donfe, a xa lu a tan gbansan bɛ. Wo yaxuie fama na tɔɔrɛ mɔɔli nan dɔxɔde wo ma.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />Xa wo mu mɛɛni yi masenyie ma naxee sɛbɛxi yi kitaabui kui, xa wo mu gaaxu wo Marigi Alatala xili xungbe magaaxuxi ya ra, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />Alatala fama nɛ fure ɲaaxi magaaxuxie dɔxɔde wo tan nun wo bɔnsɔɛ ma, naxan mu yalanma. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />A fure ɲaaxi ikonkoma nɛ wo xun na, wo nu gaaxuxi naxan ya ra Misira bɔxi ma. Na fure mɔɔli wo suxuma nɛ, a nɔ wo ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Alatala fure mɔɔli gbegbe dɔxɔma nɛ wo ma, naxee xili mu sɛbɛxi yi kitaabui kui, han wo birin gɛ sɔntɔde. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Wo tan naxee nu wuya dangi tunbuie ra koore ma, wo kɔnti xurunma nɛ, barima wo bara wo Marigi Alatala xui matandi.<verse eid="DEU 28:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Alatala fe fanyi rabaxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ, a nun a wo rawuyaxi ki naxɛ, a fama wo halakide na ki nɛ man, wo fa ɲɔn bɔxi ma a naxan fi wo ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />A wo rayensen si birin ya ma, keli duniɲa tuxui ma, sa dɔxɔ boore tuxui ra. Wo fama nɛ ala gbɛtɛe batude, wuri nun gɛmɛ daaxie, wo tan nun wo benbae mu naxee kolon. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Na sie tagi, wo mu malabui yo sɔtɔma, wo mu yire yo sɔtɔma wo sabatima dɛnnaxɛ. Alatala wo bɔɲɛe ratema nɛ, a wo yaye ramini, a wo nii tɔɔrɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Wo xa simaya findima kɔntɔfili nan na, gaaxui fama nɛ wo rasɛrɛnde kɔɛ nun yanyi ra. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Wo na na fe mɔɔli to tɛmui naxɛ, gaaxui fama wo bɔɲɛ rafede. Gɛɛsɛgɛ, wo nu fa a fala, «Xa nunmare nan nu a ra nu!» Nunmare, wo nu fa a fala, «Xa gɛɛsɛgɛ nan nu a ra nu!» <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Alatala wo xaninma nɛ kunkuie kui Misira, n a fala wo bɛ dɛnnaxɛ ma wo mu naa toma sɔnɔn. Mɛnni, wo katama nɛ wo yɛtɛ matide wo yaxuie ma konyie ra, xɛmɛe nun ginɛe, kɔnɔ mixi yo mu wo sarama.<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="DEU 28:69" />Alatala yi saatɛ nan so Annabi Munsa yi ra, a xa a mabanban e nun Isirayilakae tagi, Mowaba bɔxi ma. Yi saatɛ nun boore saatɛ tagi rasa naxan tongo Xorebe geya fari.<verse eid="DEU 28:69" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa saatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Annabi Munsa naxa Isirayila ɲama birin maxili, a a masen e bɛ, «Wo nu na Misira tɛmui naxɛ, wo fe to nɛ Alatala naxan naba Firawuna ra, a xa sɔɔrie nun a xa bɔxi birin na. <verse eid="DEU 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Wo bara fe xɔrɔxɔɛe to, tɔnxumae nun kaabanakoe a naxee raba e ra, <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />kɔnɔ han to Alatala mu xaxili fi wo ma naxan nɔma yi fee kolonde. Wo yae mu a toma, wo tuli man mu a mɛma. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Ɲɛ tongo naani bun ma a wo ratangama gbengberenyi kui. Wo xa sose nun wo xa sankirie mu kana, <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />wo mu taami don, wo mu wɛni nun beere min. Alatala bara a ɲɔxɔ rasiga wo xa fe xɔn alako wo xa nɔ a kolonde a tan nan na wo Marigi Ala ra. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Wo to so be, Xɛsibɔn mangɛ Sixɔn, nun Basan mangɛ Ogo, fa nɛ wo gerede, kɔnɔ wo naxa nɔ e ra. <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Wo naxa e xa bɔxie tongo, wo a itaxun Ruben bɔnsɔɛ ma, Gadi bɔnsɔɛ ma, nun Manasi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti keren ma. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Na nan a toxi, wo lanma wo xa bira yi saatɛ sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra, alako wo na so fe naxan yo ya ma, a xa sɔɔnɛya wo bɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />«Isirayilakae, wo tan nan malanxi yi ki to lɔxɔɛ wo Marigi Alatala ya i. Birin na be, wo xa mangɛe, wo xa yareratie, wo xa forie, wo xa sɔɔri mangɛe, <verse eid="DEU 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />wo xa ginɛe, wo xa die, nun xɔɲɛe naxee wuri sɛgɛma nun ye bama wo bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />Wo Marigi Alatala bara saatɛ mabanban kali ra. Wo na be to alako wo xa na xiri, wo tan nun wo Marigi Alatala tagi. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Na tɛmui wo tan nan na a xa ɲama ra, nun a tan nan na wo Marigi Ala ra, alɔ a kali wo benbae Iburahima, Isiyaga, nun Yaxuba bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />N mu yi saatɛ mabanbanxi kali ra wo tan gbansan xa bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />wo tan naxee na be won Marigi Alatala ya i. N a mabanbanxi wo bɔnsɔɛ nan fan bɛ naxee mu nu bari sinden.»<verse eid="DEU 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />«Wo a kolon won buxi Misira bɔxi ma ki naxɛ, nun won dangi si naxee xa bɔxie ra. <verse eid="DEU 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Wo bara yi kuye xɔnxie to yi sie nu naxee batuma, kuye naxee yailanxi wuri, gɛmɛ, gbeti, nun xɛɛma ra. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Xɛmɛ yo, ginɛ yo, bɔnsɔɛ yo, xabilɛ yo naxa gbilen wo Marigi Alatala fɔxɔ ra, birafe ra na sie xa alae batufe fɔxɔ ra. Wo ya ma, mixi yo naxa lu alɔ wuri sanke naxan pɔsɔnɛ xɔnɛ raminima. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Na mixi mɔɔli naxan bara gɛ yi kali mɛde, kɔnɔ a fa sɛɛwa a bɔɲɛ ma a falafe ra, ‹Sɔɔnɛya na n bɛ, n xa n yɛtɛ waxɔnfe raba tɛmui birin, ɲɛmɛ nun sogofure,› <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Alatala mu diɲɛma na kanyi ma. A fama nɛ a xa xɔnɛ masende a bɛ a ɲaaxi ra, barima a mu wama a firin nde xɔn. A dankɛ ragoroma nɛ a ma, naxee sɛbɛxi yi kitaabui kui. A a xili ralɔɛma nɛ duniɲa ma. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Alatala na mixi mɔɔli raminima Isirayila ɲama ya ma a dankɛ ki ma, alɔ a saatɛ sɛbɛxi ki naxɛ yi sɛriyɛ kitaabui kui.»<verse eid="DEU 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />«Wo bɔnsɔɛe naxee fama wo xanbi ra, a nun xɔɲɛe naxee kelima bɔxi makuye ma, e fama furee nun fe xɔrɔxɔɛe tode, Alatala naxee dɔxɔma wo xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="DEU 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Soda nun fɔxɔɛ fama lude bɔxi fari. Bɔxi mu nɔma rawalide, sese mu nɔma fande, hali burɛxɛ keren a mu nɔma findide a ra. Bɔxi luma nɛ alɔ Sodoma, Gomora, Adamaha, nun Seboyimi, Ala taa naxee kana a xa bɔɲɛ xɔnɛ kui. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Na tɛmui si gbɛtɛe fama nɛ maxɔrinyi tide, ‹Alatala yi bɔxi niyaxi yi ki munfe ra? A bɔɲɛ xɔnɔxi yi mɔɔli ra munfe ra?› <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />E e yaabima nɛ, ‹Yi fe rabaxi nɛ barima yi ɲama bara saatɛ kana, e benbae Marigi Alatala naxan tongo e bɛ, a to e ramini Misira bɔxi ra. <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />E bara kuyee batu e mu naxee kolonxi, Alatala mu tinxi naxee ra. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />Na fe na a toxi Alatala yi ɲaxankatɛ birin dɔxɔxi yi bɔxi ma a xa xɔnɛ kui alɔ a xa kitaabui a masenma ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />A bara a xa xɔnɛ belebele dɔxɔ a xa ɲama ma, a e tongo e xa bɔxi ma, a e keri bɔxi gbɛtɛ fan ma, e na dɛnnaxɛ yi waxati.›»<verse eid="DEU 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />«Fe naxee nɔxunxi, won Marigi Alatala nan keren peti nee kolon. Fe naxee masenxi won bɛ, nun won ma die bɛ, nee findixi won gbe nan na han duniɲa ɲɔn. A lanma won xa yi sɛriyɛ masenxi birin nabatu.»<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa laayidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />N baraka nun danka naxee birin falaxi wo bɛ, nee fama nɛ kamalide. Wo Marigi Alatala na wo rayensen yɛ tɛmui naxɛ bɔxi gbɛtɛ ma, wo wo maɲɔxun yi fee ma. <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />Xa wo gbilenma wo Marigi Alatala ma, wo man a xui suxu wo bɔɲɛ nun wo xaxili kui wo tan nun wo xa die, alɔ n a masenxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ to lɔxɔɛ, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />na tɛmui wo Marigi Alatala wo raminima nɛ konyiya kui, a kinikini wo ma, a wo ba sie ya ma a wo rayensen yɛ dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Hali wo na yire makuye konyiya kui, wo Marigi Alatala sigama nɛ wo fende, a fa wo malan <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />wo benbae xa bɔxi ma, alako wo xa naa masɔtɔ, a fa mɛɛni wo ma dangife wo benbae ra, a wo rawuya dangi e ra.<verse eid="DEU 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Na tɛmui wo Marigi Alatala yɛtɛ yati wo bɔnsɔɛ bɔɲɛ rasɛniyɛnma nɛ, alako wo xa a xanu wo bɔɲɛ nun wo xaxili birin na. Na kui wo nɔma simaya fanyi sɔtɔde. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />N yi dankɛ naxee birin sɛbɛxi wo bɛ yi ki, nee fama dɔxɔde wo yaxuie nun wo xɔnmae nan ma. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Na tɛmui wo man tuubi rabirama nɛ a bɛ, wo a xa sɛriyɛ suxu n naxan fixi wo ma to lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Wo Marigi Alatala barakɛ sama nɛ wo xa fe birin ma. Wo di gbegbe sɔtɔma nɛ, wo xa xurusee rawuyama nɛ, wo xa sansie fanma nɛ, barima wo fama nɛ rafande Alatala ma alɔ wo benbae. <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />Na nan nabama, wo na wo tuli mati a ra tɛmui naxɛ, a xa sɛriyɛ nun a xa yaamarie suxufe ra, naxee sɛbɛxi yi kitaabui kui. Na tɛmui wo wo yɛtɛ ragbilenma nɛ a ma wo bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra, wo xaxili birin na.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ala xa sɛriyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />N yi sɛriyɛ naxan falaxi wo bɛ yi ki to lɔxɔɛ, a kolon yo mu xɔnɔ wo bɛ. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />A mu na koore xa ma, alako a xa fala, «Nde nɔma tede koore ma a xa sa fa a ra won bɛ, a a xaran won bɛ alako won xa nɔ a rabade?» <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />A mu na baa kiri fan xa ma, alako a xa fala, «Nde nɔma baa igiride a xa sa fa a ra won bɛ, a man xa a xaran won bɛ alako won xa nɔ a rabade?» <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Ade, yi sɛriyɛ na wo sɛɛti ma nɛ, wo dɛ kui, a nun wo bɔɲɛ ma. Wo nɔma a rabade.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simaya sugandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />Isirayilakae, wo a mato. To lɔxɔɛ n bara simaya nun fe fanyi ti sɛɛti, faxɛ nun fe ɲaaxi fan boore sɛɛti. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />To lɔxɔɛ wo tin wo xa wo Marigi Alatala xanu, wo xa ɲɛrɛ a xa kira ma, wo xa bira a xa yaamari, a xa masenyi, nun a xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra, alako wo xa simaya fanyi sɔtɔ, wo xa wuya, alako Ala xa barakɛ sa wo ma yire a dɛnnaxɛ findima wo gbe ra. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Kɔnɔ xa wo gbilen a fɔxɔ ra, xa wo tondi a bɛ, xa wo bira kuye batufe fɔxɔ ra, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />wo sɔntɔma nɛ feo, wo mu fa bude bɔxi ma wo fama dɛnnaxɛ sɔtɔde Yurudɛn kiri ma. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />To lɔxɔɛ koore nun bɔxi na n seede ra, n bara simaya nun fe fanyi ti wo bɛ sɛɛti keren na, faxɛ nun fe ɲaaxi fan na boore sɛɛti ra. Wo xa simaya fanyi sugandi, wo tan nun wo bɔnsɔɛe. <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />Wo xa wo Marigi Alatala xanu, wo tuubi a bɛ, wo a xa fe suxu. Wo nɔma simaya sɔtɔde na ki nɛ, wo fa ɲɛ gbegbe raba bɔxi ma, Alatala dɛnnaxɛ saatɛ tongo fife ra wo benba Iburahima, Isiyaga, nun Yaxuba ma.<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Yosuwe findife Annabi Munsa ɲɔxɔɛ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Annabi Munsa naxa a fala Isirayilakae birin bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />«N bara ɲɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn sɔtɔ yi tɛmui, n mu nɔma mangɛya rabade fa. Alatala ɲan a fala nɛ n bɛ a n mu Yurudɛn igirima. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Wo Marigi Alatala yɛtɛ yati nan wo raɲɛrɛma. A sie birin faxama nɛ naxee na naakiri ma alako wo xa e xa bɔxie masɔtɔ. Yosuwe nan findima wo xa mangɛ ra, alɔ Alatala a fala ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Alatala yi sie halakima nɛ alɔ a Sixɔn nun Ogo, Amorikae xa mangɛe, halaki ki naxɛ, nun e xa bɔxie. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />A e rayarabima nɛ wo bɛ. Wo xa a xa yaamari raba e xa fe ra. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Wo limaniya, wo xa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ, wo naxa gaaxu e ya ra, barima wo Marigi Alatala na wo kantafe, a mu wo rabɛɲinma fefe ma.»<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Annabi Munsa naxa Yosuwe xili, a naxa wɔyɛn a bɛ Isirayilakae birin malanxi tagi, «I xa limaniya, i xa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ, barima i tan nan Isirayilakae raɲɛrɛma bɔxi ma Alatala dɛnnaxɛ saatɛ tongoxi wo benbae bɛ. I tan xa e xa kɛ so e yi ra. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Alatala tima nɛ i ya ra, a mu i rabɛɲinma. A mu gbilenma i fɔxɔ ra fefe ma. Hali i mu gaaxu, i man naxa i yɛtɛ rabolo.»<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Annabi Munsa to yi sɛriyɛ sɛbɛ, a naxa a taxu sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra, Lewi xa di naxee saatɛ kankira xaninma, nun Isirayila forie. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Annabi Munsa naxa a masen e bɛ, «Ɲɛ solofere yo ɲɛ solofere, wo diɲɛma doni ma ɲɛ naxan na, wo yi sɛriyɛ xaranma Bage Ti Sali lɔxɔɛ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Wo a xaranma wo xui itexi nan na Isirayilakae birin bɛ, naxee faxi salide Marigi Alatala ya i a xa yire sugandixi. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Birin malanma mɛnni nɛ, xɛmɛ, ginɛ, dimɛdi, a nun xɔɲɛ naxee na wo xɔnyi, alako e xa yi xaranyi mɛ, e xa wo Marigi Alatala binya, e xa bira yi sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Dimɛ naxee mu nu a kolonxi sinden, e fan a mɛma nɛ. Na kui e wo Marigi Alatala binya ki kolon, wo na fa bɔxi sɔtɔde Yurudɛn naakiri ma tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Alatala naxa a masen Annabi Munsa bɛ, «I faxa tɛmui bara makɔrɛ, Yosuwe xili, wo birin xa siga n ma hɔrɔmɔlingira yire. Mɛnni n fa n ma yaamari fi a ma.» Annabi Munsa nun Yosuwe naxa siga Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira yire. <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Alatala naxa mini e ma nuxui kui naxan nu tema kiri banxi sode dɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Alatala naxa a masen Annabi Munsa bɛ, «I fa na faxafe nɛ. I xa faxɛ xanbi, Isirayila ɲama fama kuyee nan batude bɔxi ma e fama sigade dɛnnaxɛ. E gbilenma nɛ saatɛ fɔxɔ ra won lanxi naxan ma. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Na tɛmui n bɔɲɛ tema nɛ, n xɔnɔ e ma han n e rabɛɲin. N nan n yatagi nɔxunma nɛ e ma, si gbɛtɛe e halaki, tɔɔrɛ nun fe xɔrɔxɔɛe fa dusu e xun na. Isirayilakae a kolonma na tɛmui nɛ, yi tɔɔrɛ e lixi nɛ barima n tan, e Marigi Ala, mu na e ya ma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />N nan n yatagi nɔxunma nɛ e ma, barima e bara fe ɲaaxi raba kuyee batufe ra.»<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />«Yakɔsi i xa bɛɛti sɛbɛ n naxan xaranma i bɛ. Munsa, i xa a xaran Isirayilakae bɛ alako e naxa nɛɛmu a ma, a man xa findi seede ra n tan nun Isirayilakae tagi. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />N fama yi ɲama xaninde bɔxi ma, xiɲɛ nun kumi xɛlɛma dɛnnaxɛ, alɔ n nan n kalixi e babae bɛ ki naxɛ. E na baloe don a fanyi ra han e belebele, e fama birade ala gbɛtɛe fɔxɔ ra, e man n ma saatɛ kana. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Tɔɔrɛe nun fe xɔrɔxɔɛe fa bira e fɔxɔ ra, yi bɛɛti fan findima seede nan na won tagi. E bɔnsɔɛ mu nɛɛmu a ma. Naxan na e xaxili kui, n a kolon. A ɲan toma e ya ma beenu e xa so bɔxi kui n nan n kalixi e bɛ naxan xa fe ra.» <verse eid="DEU 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Na lɔxɔɛ Annabi Munsa naxa na bɛɛti sɛbɛ, Ala naxan masenxi. A naxa a xaran Isirayilakae ra.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Na xanbi Alatala naxa a xa yaamari so Annabi Yosuwe yi ra, Nunu xa di. A naxa a masen a bɛ, «I xa limaniya, i xa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ. I tan nan Isirayilakae rasoma bɔxi ma n nan n kalixi e bɛ naxan xa fe ra. Won birin na a ra.»<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Annabi Munsa naxa Ala xa sɛriyɛ birin sɛbɛ kitaabui kui. <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />A to gɛ, a naxa wɔyɛn Lewikae ra, naxee Alatala xa saatɛ kankira xaninma. A naxa a masen e bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />«Wo yi kitaabui tongo, Ala xa sɛriyɛ sɛbɛxi naxan kui, wo xa a sa wo Marigi Alatala xa saatɛ kankira sɛɛti ma. A xa lu mɛnni seede ra Isirayilakae bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />barima n wo xaxili xɔrɔxɔya kolon. Kantagbele nan wo ra. Xa wo Alatala matandima n wo tagi tɛmui naxɛ, n faxa xanbi wo man a matandima nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Yakɔsi wo wo malan n sɛɛti ma, forie nun wo bɔnsɔɛ yareratie, alako n xa yi masenyi xaran wo bɛ. Koore nun bɔxi nan findima seede ra wo xili ma. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />N a kolon n faxa xanbi, Isirayilakae yunubi fe rabama nɛ, e gbilen kira fɔxɔ ra n naxan falaxi e bɛ. E na fe kobi raba naxan mu rafan Alatala ma, na raɲɔnyi fa findi e bɛ nimisɛ ra barima a bɔɲɛ tema nɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Annabi Munsa naxa yi bɛɛti birin masen Isirayila ɲama bɛ.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Munsa xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />«Koore, i tuli mati n ma wɔyɛnyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">Bɔxi, i tuli mati n fala xui ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />N ma xaranyi xa yensen yɛ alɔ tunɛ ye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">N ma masenyi xa lu alɔ xini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">naxan dɔxɔma burɛxɛe ma.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />N fa na Alatala xili nan masenfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">Wo xa won Marigi Ala tantu.»<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />«Alatala maniyaxi fanye nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">naxan mixi kantama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">A walima tinxinyi nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">A xa natɛe birin fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">A xa wɔyɛnyi mu kanama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">wule yo mu na a dɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">A tinxin.»<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />«Kɔnɔ wo tan, ɲama ɲaaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">wo bara geregiri Alatala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">Yaagi na wo bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">Wo bara findi ɲama kobi ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Ɲama daxui, ɲama xaxilitare,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">mixi lan a xa na fe mɔɔli raba a ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Wo baba mu lanxi a tan xa ma, wo daa Marigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">naxan wo findixi a xa ɲama ra?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Wo wo maɲɔxun lɔxɔɛ dangixie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">wo ɲɛe mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">wo wo babae nun forie maxɔrin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">e xa fe dangixie tagi raba wo bɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi naxa bɔxi itaxun adamadie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">A naxa bɔxie naaninyi sa Isirayila xa die xasabi ma.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Isirayila ɲama naxa findi a gbe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">Alatala naxa Yaxuba xa die findi a yɛtɛ gbe ra.»<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />«A Isirayila toxi gbengberen yire nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">A naxa a ɲɛngi sa a xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">a naxa mɛɛni a ma alɔ a ya di firinyie.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />A luxi nɛ alɔ sɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">naxan luma a xa die xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">a a gabutenyi itala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">a die xanin.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Alatala keren peti nan a xa ɲama kantaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">Ala gbɛtɛ yo mu kafu a ma.»<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />«A naxa wo rasabati geya fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">A naxa wo rabalo xɛ sansie xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">A naxa kumi nun ture ramini wo bɛ gɛmɛ longori ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />A naxa ninge nun yɛxɛɛ xiɲɛ fi wo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">A naxa yɛxɛe, sie, nun si kontonyie fi wo ma sube ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">kelife Basan bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">A naxa mɛngi fi wo ma wo naxan donma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">a naxa wɛni fi wo ma wo naxan minma.»<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />«Isirayila tinxinxi naxa belebele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">a naxa findi di fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">kɔnɔ a bara gbilen Ala fɔxɔ ra, a daa Marigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">a bara a kantama, a rakisima rayaagi.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Isirayila naxa Ala raxɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">barima a bira nɛ ala gbɛtɛe fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">e fe ɲaaxi raba.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />E naxa sɛrɛxɛ ba ɲinnɛe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">naxee mu na Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">e mu naxee kolon sinden,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">e babae mu naxee kolon.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Isirayilakae, wo bara nɛɛmu wo kantama ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">naxan wo raminixi duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">naxan simaya fima wo ma.»<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />«Alatala to bara a xa die kɛɲa to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">a naxa xɔnɔ e ma.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />A naxa a masen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">‹N xa gbilen e kantafe fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">n fa a mato fe naxan fama e lide.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">E mu fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Yanfante nan e ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />E bara n naxɔnɔ ala wulee ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">E bara n bɔɲɛ rate kuyee ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">N tan fan e raxɔnɔma nɛ mixie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">ɲama fanyi mu na naxee ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">N e bɔɲɛ rate si xaxilitare ma.»<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />«Iyo, n ma xɔnɛ bara gbo yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">han a bara mixi faxaxie ramaxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">A luma alɔ tɛ naxan bɔxi nun a daxamui ganma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">han a sa dɔxɔ geyae sanke ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />N fe ɲaaxi ragboma nɛ e fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">n nan n ma xalie birin wolima nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />N kaamɛ rasoma bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">n fure ɲaaxi rasanbama nɛ e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">n wulai sube magaaxuxie raminima nɛ e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">a nun bɔximase xɔnɛ kanyie.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Naxee na tande, fanfore nan e faxama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">Naxee na banxi kui, gaaxui nan e faxama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">E birin faxama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">xɛmɛ nun ginɛ, dimɛdi nun fori.»<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />«N nu wama nɛ e birin halakife,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">e xili xa lɔɛ duniɲa ma.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Kɔnɔ n mu tin yaxuie xa n mayele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">N mu wa e xa a maɲɔxun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">a e tan nan yi wali rabaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">Ala xa fɔxi mu a ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Xaxili kanyi mu na e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">lɔnni mu e yi.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Xa lɔnni kanyi nan e ra nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">e e sigade kolonma nɛ nu.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Yaxui keren tan nɔma Isirayilaka wulu keren nagide di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Yaxui firin nɔma birade mixi wulu fu fɔxɔ ra di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Iyo, xa e Marigi, e Kantama sa e lu e yaxuie sagoe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">na nɔma nɛ rabade.<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Yaxuie yati a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">e xa ala e kantama mu dangi Isirayila Marigi Alatala ra.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />E xa fe mu dangi Sodoma nun Gomora ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">E birin maniyaxi wɛni bili nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">naxan bogi xɔnɛe raminima,<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />naxan ye luxi alɔ bɔximase xɔnɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />Na birin nagataxi gundo nan na n xɔnyi.<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />E na bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">n nan n gbeɲɔxɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">A gbegbe mu luxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">E yigi tɛgɛ lɔxɔɛ bara makɔrɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />«Alatala fama a xa ɲama makiitide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">kɔnɔ a man kinikinima nɛ e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">barima e sɛnbɛ yo mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">Mixi yo mu na naxan nɔma e malide.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Ala e maxɔrinma nɛ fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">‹Wo xa alae na minden,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">naxee nu wo kantama,<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />wo naxee rabaloxi sube ture ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">wo nu wɛni soma naxee yi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">E xa e yɛtɛ masen wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">e xa wo rakisi, e xa wo ratanga.<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />Yakɔsi wo xa a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">n tan nan keren peti nɔma mixi rakiside.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Ala gbɛtɛ mu na fo n keren.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">N tan nan mixi faxama, n a rakeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">N tan nan mixi maxɔnɔma, n a rayalan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Nde gbɛtɛ nɔma mixi nde bade n bɛlɛxɛ?<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />N kali naxan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">n bɛlɛxɛ tixi koore ma na nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">N ɲiɲɛ. N mu faxama abadan!<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />Xa n fanfore ralugan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">xa n a suxu n bɛlɛxɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">n nan n gbeɲɔxɔma nɛ n gerefae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">n sare fima nɛ n xɔnmae ma.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />N nan n ma xalie rasiisima nɛ wuli ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">n ma fanfore sube donma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">Geresoe yo mu kisima.›»<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />«Si birin xa sɛɛwa Alatala xa ɲama ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">Alatala a xa konyie xa faxɛ ɲɔxɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">A tɔɔrɛ dɔxɔma nɛ a gerefae ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">A a xa ɲama nun a xa bɔxi xun sarama nɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Annabi Munsa nun Annabi Yosuwe, Nunu xa di, naxa yi bɛɛti masenyi birin xaran ɲama bɛ e xui itexi ra. <verse eid="DEU 32:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Annabi Munsa to gɛ Alatala xa masenyi tide Isirayilakae bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo xa yi masenyi suxu sɛnbɛ ra n naxan xaranxi wo bɛ to lɔxɔɛ. Wo xa a xaran wo xa die bɛ, alako e xa nɔ Alatala xa sɛriyɛ rabatude a fanyi ra. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Masenyi tilinxi nan yi masenyi ra, a naxa lu wo bɛ alɔ masenyi fufafui. A simaya nan fima wo ma bɔxi ma wo fama dɛnnaxɛ sɔtɔde Yurudɛn naakiri ma.»<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annabi Munsa xa faxɛ ɲɔgɔnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Na lɔxɔɛ kerenyi kui, Alatala naxa a masen Annabi Munsa bɛ, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />«Siga Abarimi geya longori, Nebo geya fari Mowaba bɔxi ma, Yeriko ya tagi. Mɛnni i xa Kanaan bɔxi mato, n naxan fima Isirayilakae ma. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />I na te geya fari, i fama saya sɔtɔde naa, i i benbae li aligiyama, alɔ i taara Haruna xa fe rabaxi ki naxɛ Horo geya fari. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Wo na sɔtɔxi nɛ, barima wo mu wo xaxili ti n na Isirayilakae ya xɔri Meriba ye yire, Kadesi biri ra, Sini gbengberenyi ma. Na kui wo mu tin n binyade ɲama ya xɔri. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Na fe na a niyaxi a i nɔma bɔxi tode yire makuye gbansan nɛ, n naxan fixi Isirayilakae ma, kɔnɔ i tan gundi mu soma naa.»<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Munsa xa dubɛ Isirayila bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Beenu Annabi Munsa xa laaxira, Ala xa mixi, a duba nɛ Isirayilakae bɛ. A xa dubɛ masenyi nan ya:<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />«Alatala keli nɛ Turusinina geya fari alɔ soge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">A naxa te Seyiri bɔxi ma Isirayilakae nu na dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">A naxa keli Paran geya yirefanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">malekɛ gbegbe biraxi a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Alatala Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xanuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">A a xa mixie kantama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">naxee birama a xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Annabi Munsa bara a xa sɛriyɛ fi won ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">Na sɛriyɛ findixi Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ xa dariyɛ mate nan na.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Alatala findixi Isirayila xa Mangɛ nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">ɲama mangɛe xa malanyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">e nun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe birin na.»<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />«Alatala xa Ruben bɔnsɔɛ xa simaya xun masa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">A xa mixie xa gbo.»<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Annabi Munsa yi masenyi nan ti Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">«Alatala xa Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xui ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">alako a xa gbilen a xa ɲama ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">A na katafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Alatala xa a mali a yaxuie ya ra.»<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Annabi Munsa yi masenyi nan ti Lewi bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">«Alatala, i bara i xa tɔnxumae Tumimi nun Urimi so Lewi bɔnsɔɛ yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">Bɔnsɔɛ tinxinxi nan e ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">i naxee mato Masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">i naxee makiiti Meriba ye xa fe ra.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />E mu birama e baba nun e nga sagoe xa fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">xa na mu e ngaxakerenyie nun e xa die,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">e tan birama i xa masenyi gbansan nan fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">e birama i xa saatɛ nan tun fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />E tan nan i xa yaamari masenma Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">e tan nan i xa sɛriyɛ raxaranma Isirayilakae birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">E tan nan man surayi bama sɛrɛxɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">e sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ba i xa sɛrɛxɛbade.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Alatala, i xa sɛnbɛ fi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">i xa barakɛ sa e xa fe birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">i xa e gerefae rakori,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">i xa e yaxuie rabira</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">alako e naxa gbilen xanbi ra fefe ma.»<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Annabi Munsa yi masenyi nan ti Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">«Alatala xanuntenyi nan lanxi e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">E Marigi Ala e ratangama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">a man luma nɛ e tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">a e kantama tɛmui birin.»<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Annabi Munsa yi masenyi nan ti Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">«Alatala bara barakɛ sa e xa bɔxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">E ye sɔtɔma nɛ keli koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">e ye sɔtɔ keli bɔxi bun ma.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Soge sansie rafanma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">kike yo kike bogie gbeeli luma nɛ naa.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />E daxamui fanyi sɔtɔma nɛ e xa geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:15">naxee tixi naa kabi a fɔlɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Ala xa yi bɔxi daxamui se fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Naxan wɔyɛn wuri bili radɛxɛxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">a xa hinnɛ Yusufu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">a naxan sugandixi mangɛ ra a ngaxakerenyie tagi.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Xunnakeli na Yusufu bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">A sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ ninge tuura,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">feri firin nan na a xa geresose ra alɔ sɛxɛ ninge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">A sie birin bɔnbɔma nee nan na han yire makuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Efirami xa di wuyaxie nan a feri singe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Manasi xa di wuyaxie nan a feri firin nde ra.»<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Annabi Munsa yi masenyi nan ti Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">«Sabulon bɔnsɔɛ, wo xa sɛɛwa yulɛya nan kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">Isakari bɔnsɔɛ, wo xa sɛɛwa wo xa kiri banxi nan kui.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Wo wo dɔxɔbooree xilima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">wo sɛrɛxɛ ba geya fari Ala wa xɔn ki ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">barima wo wo baloe sɔtɔma fɔxɔ ye nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">a nun hɛɛri naxan na mɛyɛnyi kui.»<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Annabi Munsa yi masenyi nan ti Gadi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">«Ala xa barakɛ sa mixi xa fe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">naxan Gadi xa fe gboma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadi malabuma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">alɔ yɛtɛ naxan a xa sube ibɔɔxi donma.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Gadi bara bɔxi fanyi findi a gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">alɔ mangɛ naxan a ɲɛrɛma ɲama ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">A bara Alatala xa natɛ rakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">a man bara Ala xa kiiti sa Isirayila ma.»<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Annabi Munsa yi masenyi nan ti Dana bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">«Dana luxi nɛ alɔ yɛtɛ yɔrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">naxan tuganma Basan bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Annabi Munsa yi masenyi nan ti Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">«Xunnafanyi gbegbe na Nafatali nan bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">Alatala a rakamalixi fe fanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">A xa bɔxi xa gbo yɛ sogegorode nun yirefanyi.»<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Annabi Munsa yi masenyi nan ti Aseri bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">«Alatala xa barakɛ sa Aseri, Yaxuba xa die tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">A ngaxakerenyie xa hinnɛ a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">A xa ture xa gbo han.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />A xa naadɛe xa yailan wure nun wure gbeeli ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">A sɛnbɛ xa bu alɔ a xa simaya.»<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />«Isirayila, Ala maniyɛ yo mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">A a ɲɛrɛma koore ma fafe ra i malide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">A nuxui igirima nɔrɛ ra.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Ala, fɔlɛ mu naxan bɛ, na nan i kantama ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">a bɛlɛxɛ na i bun kabi fe fɔlɔ fɔlɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">A tan nan i yaxuie kerima i ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">a man fa a masen i bɛ i xa e halaki.<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Isirayila sabatima kantari nan kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ luma Ala niini nan bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">Mɛngi nun wɛni gboma nɛ na bɔxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">ye fan kelima nɛ koore ma.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Sɛɛwɛ na wo bɛ, Isirayilakae.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Wo maniyɛ yo mu na sie tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Alatala naxan kisixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">a naxan kantaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">a naxan xun nakelixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Wo yaxuie fama nɛ e magorode wo ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">wo fan e xa batudee kanama nɛ.»<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Munsa xa faxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Annabi Munsa naxa te Nebo geya fari, Mowaba bɔxi ma, han Pisiga geya, naxan na Yeriko sogetede. Alatala naxa bɔxi birin masen a bɛ, keli Galadi a sa dɔxɔ Dana ra, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />Nafatali bɔxi, Efirami nun Manasi xa bɔxi, Yuda xa bɔxi han baa ma naxan na sogegorode, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />Negewi bɔxi, a sa raɲɔn Yurudɛn longorie ra, Yeriko lanbanyi, tugi bili taa, han Sowari. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Alatala naxa a masen a bɛ, «I ya ti bɔxi ra n naxan saatɛ tongoxi Iburahima, Isiyaga, nun Yaxuba bɛ. N naxa a fala e bɛ, ‹N yi bɔxi fima wo bɔnsɔɛ nan ma.› N xa na bɔxi masen i bɛ, kɔnɔ i mu soma naa.»<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Annabi Munsa, Alatala xa konyi, naxa laaxira mɛnni, Mowaba bɔxi ma, alɔ Alatala a masen ki naxɛ. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Alatala naxa a ragata Mowaba bɔxi ma gulunba kui Beti Peyori ya tagi. Mixi yo mu nɔxi a xa gaburi yire kolonde han to. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Annabi Munsa laaxiraxi a ɲɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nan ma. Na birin a ya nu se toma a fanyi ra, a sɛnbɛ fan nu gbo. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Isirayilakae naxa a wa Mowaba bɔxi ma xi tongo saxan bun ma. E Annabi Munsa xa ɲɔn fe raba na ki nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Annabi Munsa nu bara a bɛlɛxɛ sa Annabi Yosuwe ma, Nunu xa di, a fa rafe xaxilimaya ra. Isirayilakae naxa Yosuwe xui rabatu birafe Annabi Munsa xa yaamarie fɔxɔ ra, Alatala naxee fixi a ma.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Isirayila bɔxi ma, namiɲɔnmɛ yo mu nu na na naxan maniyama Annabi Munsa ra. A wɔyɛn Ala ra ya nun ya. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Ala a xɛɛ nɛ Misira fe kaabanakoe rabade Firawuna, a xa yareratie, nun a xa mixi birin xili ma. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Annabi Munsa walixi sɛnbɛ magaaxuxi nan na Isirayilakae birin ya xɔri.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>